#: src/index.md:1
msgid "Rust for C++ Programmers"
msgstr "写给 C++ 程序员的 Rust 入门手册"

#: src/index.md:3
msgid ""
"You have written C and C++ for years. You know what lives on the stack and "
"what lives on the heap, you have chased a dangling pointer through a "
"debugger at 2 AM, you have called OpenGL or Vulkan through a C API, and you "
"know how a large project is compiled, linked and held together with CMake. "
"You do not need another tutorial that explains what a pointer is."
msgstr ""
"你已经写了多年的 C 和 C++。你清楚什么东西放在栈上、什么东西放在堆上；你曾在凌晨两点用调试器追查悬垂指针；你通过 C API 调用过 OpenGL"
" 或 Vulkan；你也知道一个大型项目是如何编译、链接，并用 CMake 组织起来的。你不需要又一本解释“指针是什么”的教程。"

#: src/index.md:9
msgid ""
"This book teaches Rust **starting from what you already know**. Every "
"chapter begins with the C++ you would write, shows the Rust equivalent, and "
"spends its time on the places where your C++ intuition helps and, more "
"importantly, where it misleads you."
msgstr ""
"本书**从你已经掌握的知识出发**讲授 Rust。每一章都先给出你会写的 C++ 代码，再展示对应的 Rust 写法，并把篇幅花在那些 C++ "
"直觉能帮上忙、更重要的是会误导你的地方。"

#: src/index.md:14
msgid "What makes this book different"
msgstr "本书有何不同"

#: src/index.md:16
msgid ""
"**C++ first.** RAII vs `Drop`, `std::move` vs Rust moves, `std::mutex` vs "
"`Mutex<T>`, CMake vs Cargo, templates vs generics, `shared_ptr` vs `Arc`."
msgstr ""
"**以 C++ 为起点。** RAII 与 `Drop`、`std::move` 与 Rust 的移动、`std::mutex` 与 "
"`Mutex<T>`、CMake 与 Cargo、模板与泛型、`shared_ptr` 与 `Arc`。"

#: src/index.md:18
msgid ""
"**Interactive memory diagrams.** Ownership, borrowing and lifetimes are "
"explained with step-through diagrams of the stack and the heap, so you can "
"watch exactly what a move or a borrow does."
msgstr "**交互式内存图。** 所有权、借用和生命周期都配有可逐步播放的栈与堆示意图，你可以清楚地看到一次移动或一次借用究竟做了什么。"

#: src/index.md:21
msgid ""
"**Code you can run in the page.** Every Rust example has a ▶ button that "
"compiles and runs it on the official [Rust Playground](https://play.rust-"
"lang.org), and a link that opens it there so you can inspect the assembly."
msgstr ""
"**可以在页面中直接运行的代码。** 每个 Rust 示例都有一个 ▶ 按钮，会在官方的 [Rust "
"Playground](https://play.rust-lang.org) 上编译并运行它；还有一个链接可以在 Playground "
"中打开它，方便你查看汇编。"

#: src/index.md:24
msgid ""
"**Graphics and engine programming.** After the general chapters, Part IV "
"applies everything to the problems you actually have: handles and arenas, "
"ECS and the borrow checker, SIMD, OpenGL and Vulkan FFI, wgpu, and a small "
"renderer."
msgstr ""
"**图形与引擎编程。** 在通用章节之后，第四部分把所学内容应用到你真正会遇到的问题上：句柄与 arena、ECS 与借用检查器、SIMD、OpenGL"
" 与 Vulkan 的 FFI、wgpu，以及一个小型渲染器。"

#: src/index.md:29
msgid "Who this is for"
msgstr "本书的读者"

#: src/index.md:31
msgid "You should be comfortable with:"
msgstr "你应当熟悉："

#: src/index.md:33
msgid ""
"C: the stack and the heap, pointers, manual memory management, file I/O, C "
"APIs such as OpenGL and Vulkan, and basic computer architecture (caches, "
"alignment, what a cache line is);"
msgstr ""
"C：栈与堆、指针、手动内存管理、文件 I/O、OpenGL 和 Vulkan 这类 C API，以及基本的计算机体系结构（缓存、对齐、什么是缓存行）；"

#: src/index.md:36
msgid ""
"C++: classes, constructors and destructors, operator overloading, templates "
"as a user, and the STL (containers, `std::thread`, `std::mutex`, streams);"
msgstr ""
"C++：类、构造函数与析构函数、运算符重载、作为使用者的模板，以及 STL（容器、`std::thread`、`std::mutex`、流）；"

#: src/index.md:38
msgid ""
"building large projects: compilers, linkers, static and dynamic libraries, "
"CMake."
msgstr "构建大型项目：编译器、链接器、静态库与动态库、CMake。"

#: src/index.md:41
msgid ""
"You do **not** need modern C++ expertise. If you are not sure what an rvalue"
" reference is or have never written a template metaprogram, that is fine: "
"where Rust borrows an idea from modern C++, this book explains the idea from"
" scratch."
msgstr ""
"你**不需要**精通现代 C++。如果你不确定右值引用是什么，或者从没写过模板元编程，都没有关系：凡是 Rust 借鉴了现代 C++ "
"思想的地方，本书都会从头解释。"

#: src/index.md:45
msgid "How the book is organized"
msgstr "本书的结构"

#: src/index.md:47
msgid ""
"**Getting started**: how to read the book and how to set up the toolchain."
msgstr "**入门**：如何阅读本书，以及如何安装工具链。"

#: src/index.md:48
msgid ""
"**Part I: The language, from C++**: Cargo, types, ownership, borrowing, "
"lifetimes, enums, errors, traits, collections, closures, smart pointers and "
"modules."
msgstr ""
"**第一部分：从 C++ 出发学习语言**：Cargo、类型、所有权、借用、生命周期、枚举、错误处理、Trait、集合、闭包、智能指针与模块。"

#: src/index.md:51
msgid ""
"**Part II: Tools and the ecosystem**: testing, benchmarks and tooling, "
"logging and diagnostics, and crates.io."
msgstr "**第二部分：工具与生态**：测试、基准测试与工具，日志与诊断，以及 crates.io。"

#: src/index.md:53
msgid ""
"**Part III: Systems programming**: concurrency, networking and RPC, memory "
"layout and performance, `unsafe`, FFI with C and C++, macros."
msgstr "**第三部分：系统编程**：并发、网络与 RPC、内存布局与性能、`unsafe`、与 C 和 C++ 的 FFI、宏。"

#: src/index.md:55
msgid ""
"**Part IV: Graphics and engine programming**: handles and arenas, ECS, math "
"and SIMD, OpenGL, Vulkan, wgpu, OpenXR, windowing and the game loop, user "
"interfaces, assets and build scripts, hot reloading, and a case study."
msgstr ""
"**第四部分：图形与引擎编程**：句柄与 Arena、ECS、数学与 "
"SIMD、OpenGL、Vulkan、wgpu、OpenXR、窗口与游戏循环、用户界面、资源与构建脚本、热重载，以及一个案例研究。"

