#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:35
msgid ""
"Rust examples are live. Press ▶ to compile and run them on the Rust "
"Playground; edit them first if you like. The link under each example opens "
"it on the Playground, where the **⋯** menu next to _Run_ shows the generated"
" assembly, LLVM IR or MIR. Some examples hide setup lines; click the eye "
"icon to show them."
msgstr ""
"Rust 示例是可运行的。按 ▶ 即可在 Rust Playground 上编译并运行；也可以先修改再运行。每个示例下方的链接会在 Playground"
" 中打开它，在那里，_Run_ 旁边的 **⋯** 菜单可以显示生成的汇编、LLVM IR 或 MIR。有些示例隐藏了准备代码，点击眼睛图标即可显示。"

#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:41
msgid ""
"Interactive diagrams have **Back** and **Next** buttons, a slider, and "
"respond to the ← and → keys when focused. Where a diagram has tabs, the C++ "
"tab and the Rust tab show the same program in both languages."
msgstr ""
"交互式示意图有**上一步**和**下一步**按钮以及一个滑块，获得焦点时也可以用 ← 和 → 键操作。带标签页的示意图中，C++ 标签和 Rust "
"标签用两种语言展示同一个程序。"

#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:45
msgid "Callouts mark three kinds of aside:"
msgstr "提示框分为三种："

#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:50
msgid "Places where doing what you would do in C++ leads you astray."
msgstr "照搬 C++ 的做法会把你带偏的地方。"

#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:57
msgid "What the compiler generates and what it costs."
msgstr "编译器生成了什么，以及代价是多少。"

#: src/intro/how-to-read.md:64
msgid "How the topic plays out in graphics and engine code."
msgstr "这个主题在图形和引擎代码中如何体现。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:3
msgid ""
"A C++ toolchain is something you assemble: a compiler (or three), a build "
"system, a package manager, a debugger, a formatter, a linter and a test "
"framework, each from a different vendor. Rust ships almost all of that as "
"one install. This chapter gets it onto your machine and maps each piece to "
"what you already use."
msgstr ""
"C++ 工具链需要你自己拼装：一个（或三个）编译器、一个构建系统、一个包管理器、调试器、格式化工具、静态检查工具和测试框架，分别来自不同的厂商。Rust"
" 只需一次安装就能提供几乎全部这些工具。本章带你把它装到机器上，并把每个部件对应到你已经在用的工具。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:9
msgid "Installing with rustup"
msgstr "用 rustup 安装"

#: src/intro/setup.md:11
msgid ""
"Install Rust with [rustup](https://rustup.rs), the official toolchain "
"manager. On Linux and macOS:"
msgstr "用官方工具链管理器 [rustup](https://rustup.rs) 安装 Rust。在 Linux 和 macOS 上："

#: src/intro/setup.md:15
msgid "'=https'"
msgstr ""

#: src/intro/setup.md:18
msgid ""
"On Windows, download and run `rustup-init.exe` from the same site. Rust on "
"Windows uses the MSVC linker and Windows SDK by default, so install the "
"\"Desktop development with C++\" workload of Visual Studio (or the Build "
"Tools) first. You almost certainly have it already."
msgstr ""
"在 Windows 上，从同一网站下载并运行 `rustup-init.exe`。Windows 上的 Rust 默认使用 MSVC 链接器和 "
"Windows SDK，所以请先安装 Visual Studio（或 Build Tools）的“使用 C++ 的桌面开发”工作负载。你多半已经装好了。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:23
msgid ""
"rustup installs into your home directory (`~/.cargo` and `~/.rustup`) and "
"puts these on your `PATH`:"
msgstr "rustup 安装在你的主目录中（`~/.cargo` 和 `~/.rustup`），并把以下工具加入 `PATH`："

