#: src/intro/setup.md:81
msgid ""
"So `aarch64-linux-android` reads \"64-bit ARM, Linux kernel, Android "
"environment\": the vendor field is simply dropped, as Android's own "
"toolchain does. The last part matters more than it looks: `windows-msvc` and"
" `windows-gnu` produce binaries that cannot link against each other's C++ "
"libraries, exactly as with MSVC and MinGW builds in C++."
msgstr ""
"所以 `aarch64-linux-android` 读作“64 位 ARM、Linux 内核、Android "
"环境”：厂商字段被直接省略了，Android 自己的工具链也是这么写的。最后一部分比看上去更重要：`windows-msvc` 和 `windows-"
"gnu` 生成的二进制文件无法互相链接对方的 C++ 库，这和 C++ 中 MSVC 与 MinGW 的构建完全一样。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:87
msgid ""
"`rustc -vV` prints your host triple (the `host:` line), and `rustc --print "
"target-list` lists every triple the compiler knows. To build for another "
"one, install its standard library with `rustup` and pass `--target`:"
msgstr ""
"`rustc -vV` 会打印你的主机三元组（`host:` 那一行），`rustc --print target-list` "
"会列出编译器知道的所有三元组。要为另一个平台构建，先用 `rustup` 安装它的标准库，再传入 `--target`："

#: src/intro/setup.md:97
msgid ""
"The standard library for each target is downloaded prebuilt. You still need "
"a linker for the target platform (the Android NDK, for example), just as in "
"C++."
msgstr "每个目标平台的标准库都是预编译好下载的。不过你仍然需要目标平台的链接器（例如 Android NDK），这一点和 C++ 一样。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:100
msgid "Editors"
msgstr "编辑器"

#: src/intro/setup.md:102
msgid ""
"Install **rust-analyzer**. It provides completion, go-to-definition, inline "
"type hints and the compiler's errors as you type."
msgstr "安装 **rust-analyzer**。它提供补全、跳转到定义、内联类型提示，并在你输入时显示编译器错误。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:105
msgid ""
"**VS Code**: install the _rust-analyzer_ extension. For debugging, add "
"_CodeLLDB_ (Linux/macOS) or use the C/C++ extension's debugger (Windows)."
msgstr ""
"**VS Code**：安装 _rust-analyzer_ 扩展。调试可以加装 _CodeLLDB_（Linux/macOS），或使用 C/C++ "
"扩展自带的调试器（Windows）。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:107
msgid "**JetBrains**: _RustRover_, or the Rust plugin for CLion."
msgstr "**JetBrains**：_RustRover_，或 CLion 的 Rust 插件。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:108
msgid ""
"**Visual Studio**: no first-class support; most Windows developers use VS "
"Code or RustRover for Rust and keep Visual Studio for debugging mixed C++ "
"and Rust."
msgstr ""
"**Visual Studio**：没有一流的支持；大多数 Windows 开发者用 VS Code 或 RustRover 写 Rust，保留 "
"Visual Studio 用来调试 C++ 与 Rust 混合的程序。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:111
msgid "**Vim, Emacs, Helix, Zed**: all speak the language server protocol."
msgstr "**Vim、Emacs、Helix、Zed**：都支持语言服务器协议。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:116
msgid ""
"rust-analyzer shows the inferred type of every `let` binding in grey. Leave "
"this on while you learn. Rust infers more than C++ `auto` does (types flow "
"backward from later uses too), and the hints show you what the compiler "
"decided."
msgstr ""
"rust-analyzer 会用灰色显示每个 `let` 绑定推断出的类型。学习期间请保持开启。Rust 的类型推断比 C++ 的 `auto` "
"更强（类型也会从后面的用法反向推导），这些提示能让你看到编译器的判断。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:123
msgid "Debuggers and profilers you already know"
msgstr "你熟悉的调试器和性能分析器"

#: src/intro/setup.md:125
msgid ""
"Rust compiles to native code with standard debug info (DWARF on Linux and "
"macOS, PDB on Windows), so your existing tools work:"
msgstr ""
"Rust 编译为带有标准调试信息的本机代码（Linux 和 macOS 上是 DWARF，Windows 上是 PDB），所以你现有的工具都能用："

#: src/intro/setup.md:128
msgid ""
"**GDB and LLDB** work directly. `rust-gdb` and `rust-lldb` are wrappers that"
" add pretty-printers for `Vec`, `String`, `Option` and friends."
msgstr ""
"**GDB 和 LLDB** 可以直接使用。`rust-gdb` 和 `rust-lldb` 是包装脚本，为 "
"`Vec`、`String`、`Option` 等类型添加了美化输出。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:130
msgid ""
"**Visual Studio's debugger** and **WinDbg** read the PDBs, with natvis "
"visualizers for standard types."
msgstr "**Visual Studio 调试器**和 **WinDbg** 可以读取 PDB，并通过 natvis 可视化标准类型。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:132
msgid ""
"**RenderDoc, Nsight Graphics, PIX** and **Radeon GPU Profiler** do not care "
"what language issued the API calls."
msgstr ""
"**RenderDoc、Nsight Graphics、PIX** 和 **Radeon GPU Profiler** 并不关心 API "
"调用来自哪种语言。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:134
msgid ""
"**perf, VTune, Superluminal, Tracy, Instruments** all work. Tracy has a Rust"
" client (the `tracy-client` crate)."
msgstr ""
"**perf、VTune、Superluminal、Tracy、Instruments** 都能用。Tracy 有 Rust 客户端（`tracy-"
"client` crate）。"

