#: src/intro/setup.md:180
msgid ""
"Do not benchmark debug builds. Rust's debug builds are much slower than C++ "
"`-O0` builds in relative terms, because so much of Rust (iterators, "
"`Option`, small methods) relies on inlining. For games, set `opt-level = 1` "
"for your own code in debug and `opt-level = 3` for dependencies. The [Cargo "
"chapter](../foundations/cargo.md) shows how."
msgstr ""
"不要对调试构建做性能测试。相对而言，Rust 的调试构建比 C++ 的 `-O0` 构建慢得多，因为 Rust "
"的很多东西（迭代器、`Option`、小方法）都依赖内联。对于游戏，可以在调试构建中为你自己的代码设置 `opt-level = 1`，为依赖设置 "
"`opt-level = 3`。[Cargo 一章](../foundations/cargo.md)介绍了具体做法。"

#: src/intro/setup.md:188
msgid "The Playground"
msgstr "Playground"

#: src/intro/setup.md:190
msgid ""
"For quick experiments you do not need a project at all. The [Rust "
"Playground](https://play.rust-lang.org) compiles and runs code in the "
"browser, can show assembly, LLVM IR and MIR, and has the 100 most popular "
"crates available. Every runnable example in this book uses it."
msgstr ""
"做快速实验时根本不需要建项目。[Rust Playground](https://play.rust-lang.org) "
"可以在浏览器中编译并运行代码，能显示汇编、LLVM IR 和 MIR，并且提供最流行的 100 个 crate。本书所有可运行的示例都使用它。"

