#: src/intro/setup.md:199
msgid ""
"Set a breakpoint on the `println!` line in your debugger of choice and step "
"into it. What do you see?"
msgstr "在你常用的调试器中，在 `println!` 那一行设置断点并单步进入。你看到了什么？"

