#: src/intro/syntax.md:195
msgid ""
"In C++ you can write `[[my_engine::hot]]` anywhere, and a compiler that does"
" not recognize it ignores it. Rust has no syntax for declaring an attribute "
"and does not ignore unknown ones: `#[hot]` with no definition in scope is a "
"compile error. A custom attribute is always a **procedural macro**, a "
"function that receives the code the attribute is attached to and returns the"
" code that replaces it. There are two ways to declare one:"
msgstr ""
"在 C++ 里，你可以在任何地方写 `[[my_engine::hot]]`，不认识它的编译器会直接忽略。Rust "
"没有声明属性的专门语法，也不会忽略未知的属性：作用域里没有定义的 `#[hot]` "
"是编译错误。自定义属性永远是一个**过程宏**：一个函数，接收属性所附着的代码，并返回用来替换它的代码。声明的方式有两种："

#: src/intro/syntax.md:202
msgid "You want"
msgstr "你想要的"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:202
msgid "Declare it with"
msgstr "用什么声明"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:202
msgid "It receives"
msgstr "它接收什么"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:204
msgid "`#[timed]` on a function, module or type"
msgstr "用在函数、模块或类型上的 `#[timed]`"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:204
msgid "`#[proc_macro_attribute] pub fn timed(...)`"
msgstr ""

#: src/intro/syntax.md:204
msgid "The attribute's arguments and the item; it returns a replacement item"
msgstr "属性的参数和条目；返回一个替换后的条目"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:205
msgid "`#[derive(Inspect)]` plus a helper `#[inspect(skip)]` on fields"
msgstr "`#[derive(Inspect)]`，加上用在字段上的辅助属性 `#[inspect(skip)]`"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:205
msgid "`#[proc_macro_derive(Inspect, attributes(inspect))]`"
msgstr ""

#: src/intro/syntax.md:205
msgid ""
"The type definition; it returns extra items, such as an `impl`. The "
"`attributes(...)` list declares the helper attributes"
msgstr "类型定义；返回额外的条目，比如一个 `impl`。`attributes(...)` 列表声明了辅助属性"

#: src/intro/syntax.md:207
msgid ""
"Procedural macros must live in their own crate, marked as a `proc-macro` "
"crate, because the compiler builds and runs them before it compiles the code"
" that uses them. A minimal setup is a workspace with two crates:"
msgstr ""
"过程宏必须放在单独的 crate 里，并标记为 `proc-macro` "
"crate，因为编译器要先构建并运行它们，然后才编译使用它们的代码。最小的配置是一个包含两个 crate 的工作区："

#: src/intro/syntax.md:211
msgid ""
"```text\n"
"game/\n"
"├── Cargo.toml               [workspace] members = [\"game\", \"game-macros\"]\n"
"├── game-macros/\n"
"│   ├── Cargo.toml\n"
"│   └── src/lib.rs           the macros\n"
"└── game/\n"
"    ├── Cargo.toml           [dependencies] game-macros = { path = \"../game-macros\" }\n"
"    └── src/main.rs          uses them\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/intro/syntax.md:222
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# game-macros/Cargo.toml\n"
"[package]\n"
"name = \"game-macros\"\n"
"version = \"0.1.0\"\n"
"edition = \"2024\"\n"
"\n"
"[lib]\n"
"proc-macro = true\n"
"\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"syn = { version = \"2\", features = [\"full\"] }   # parses Rust code into a syntax tree\n"
"quote = \"1\"                                     # turns Rust-like templates back into code\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

