"`quote!` is a template: `#name` inserts a value, and `#(#rows),*` repeats "
"for each element, like a parameter pack expansion. Errors are returned as "
"`compile_error!` tokens that point at the user's code, so a mistake reads "
"like any other compiler error."
msgstr ""
"`quote!` 是一个模板：`#name` 插入一个值，`#(#rows),*` 对每个元素重复一次，类似参数包展开。错误以 "
"`compile_error!` token 的形式返回，并指向用户的代码，所以错误信息读起来和其他编译错误一样。"

