#: src/intro/syntax.md:382
msgid ""
"Unlike C++, an attribute macro can rewrite the item completely, so it can do"
" what would need a code generator in a C++ engine: register a component, "
"generate editor bindings, or wrap a system with profiling. To see what a "
"macro generated, install `cargo-expand` and run `cargo expand`: it prints "
"your code after macro expansion, the way `-E` shows preprocessor output. The"
" [Macros chapter](../systems/macros.md#procedural-macros) covers the third "
"kind of procedural macro (function-like, `name!(...)`) and when a macro is "
"the right tool at all."
msgstr ""
"和 C++ 不同，属性宏可以完全重写它所附着的条目，所以它能做那些在 C++ "
"引擎里需要代码生成器才能做的事：注册组件、生成编辑器绑定，或者给一个系统包上性能分析。想看宏生成了什么，可以安装 `cargo-expand` 并运行 "
"`cargo expand`：它会打印宏展开之后的代码，就像 `-E` "
"显示预处理器的输出一样。第三种过程宏（类函数宏，`name!(...)`），以及什么时候才真正需要宏，见[宏](../systems/macros.md#过程宏)一章。"

