#: src/foundations/cargo.md:200
msgid ""
"`cargo build --features hot-reload` enables a feature, and `--no-default-"
"features` turns off the defaults. Features are meant to be _additive_: "
"enabling one must not break code that does not use it, because if two crates"
" in your build enable different features of a shared dependency, Cargo "
"compiles that dependency once with the union of both."
msgstr ""
"`cargo build --features hot-reload` 启用一个 feature，`--no-default-features` "
"关闭默认 feature。feature 应当是<em>可叠加的</em>：启用一个 feature 不能破坏不使用它的代码，因为如果构建中的两个 "
"crate 启用了某个共同依赖的不同 feature，Cargo 只会用两者的并集把这个依赖编译一次。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:206
msgid "Build profiles"
msgstr "构建配置"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:208
msgid ""
"Cargo has a `dev` profile (`cargo build`) and a `release` profile (`cargo "
"build --release`). You can tune them, and you can tune them per dependency, "
"which is invaluable for games:"
msgstr ""
"Cargo 有 `dev` 配置（`cargo build`）和 `release` 配置（`cargo build "
"--release`）。你可以调整它们，甚至可以针对单个依赖调整，这对游戏非常有用："

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:212
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[profile.dev]\n"
"opt-level = 1            # light optimization for your own code: still debuggable\n"
"\n"
"[profile.dev.package.\"*\"]\n"
"opt-level = 3            # fully optimize all dependencies, even in dev builds\n"
"\n"
"[profile.release]\n"
"lto = \"thin\"             # link-time optimization across crates\n"
"codegen-units = 1        # better optimization, slower build\n"
"debug = \"line-tables-only\"  # keep symbols for profilers and crash reports\n"
"panic = \"abort\"          # no unwinding tables; a panic kills the process\n"
"\n"
"[profile.profiling]      # a custom profile: cargo build --profile profiling\n"
"inherits = \"release\"\n"
"debug = true\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

