#: src/foundations/cargo.md:243
msgid "What ends up in the binary"
msgstr "二进制文件里有什么"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:245
msgid ""
"By default, Rust links all Rust code **statically**. A Rust executable "
"contains your code, every dependency and the parts of the standard library "
"you use. It links dynamically only to the platform's C runtime and system "
"libraries (libc, `kernel32.dll`, and so on), plus whatever C libraries you "
"link explicitly."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，Rust 会把所有 Rust 代码**静态**链接。一个 Rust "
"可执行文件包含你的代码、所有依赖，以及你用到的标准库部分。它只动态链接平台的 C 运行时和系统库（libc、`kernel32.dll` "
"等），以及你显式链接的 C 库。"

