#: src/foundations/cargo.md:295
msgid ""
"A large project is a **workspace**: several packages that share one "
"`Cargo.lock`, one `target/` directory and common settings. It is the "
"equivalent of a top-level `CMakeLists.txt` with `add_subdirectory`."
msgstr ""
"大型项目是一个**工作区**（workspace）：若干个包共享同一个 `Cargo.lock`、同一个 `target/` "
"目录和公共设置。它相当于一个用 `add_subdirectory` 组织起来的顶层 `CMakeLists.txt`。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:312
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# engine/Cargo.toml\n"
"[workspace]\n"
"members = [\"crates/*\", \"apps/*\"]\n"
"resolver = \"3\"\n"
"\n"
"[workspace.package]\n"
"edition = \"2024\"\n"
"version = \"0.1.0\"\n"
"\n"
"[workspace.dependencies]   # pick versions once, use them everywhere\n"
"glam = \"0.30\"\n"
"ash = \"0.38\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:327
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# engine/crates/engine-render/Cargo.toml\n"
"[package]\n"
"name = \"engine-render\"\n"
"edition.workspace = true\n"
"version.workspace = true\n"
"\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"glam.workspace = true\n"
"ash.workspace = true\n"
"engine-math = { path = \"../engine-math\" }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:340
msgid ""
"Splitting a project into crates matters more than splitting C++ into "
"libraries, because **the crate is the unit of parallel and incremental "
"compilation**. A single huge crate compiles serially at the front end; a "
"graph of mid-sized crates builds in parallel. The [project organization "
"chapter](project-organization.md) discusses how to draw those boundaries."
msgstr ""
"把项目拆分成 crate 比把 C++ 拆分成库更重要，因为 **crate 是并行编译和增量编译的单位**。一个巨大的 crate "
"在前端只能串行编译；由中等大小的 crate 组成的依赖图则可以并行构建。[项目组织一章](project-"
"organization.md)讨论了如何划定这些边界。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:350
msgid ""
"Rust compile times are comparable to template-heavy C++. The levers you "
"have:"
msgstr "Rust 的编译时间与大量使用模板的 C++ 相当。你可以利用的手段有："

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:352
msgid ""
"Split the engine into crates along stable boundaries (math, ECS, renderer, "
"assets), so a change rebuilds only what depends on it."
msgstr "沿着稳定的边界（数学、ECS、渲染器、资源）把引擎拆成多个 crate，这样一次修改只会重新构建依赖它的部分。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:354
msgid "Use `cargo check` while editing; it skips code generation."
msgstr "编辑时使用 `cargo check`；它跳过代码生成。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:355
msgid ""
"Optimize dependencies in dev builds (shown above) so you can run debug "
"builds at playable frame rates."
msgstr "在 dev 构建中优化依赖（如上所示），让调试构建也能以可玩的帧率运行。"

#: src/foundations/cargo.md:357
msgid ""
"On Linux, use a faster linker (`mold` or `lld`); linking is often the "
"slowest step of an incremental build."
msgstr "在 Linux 上使用更快的链接器（`mold` 或 `lld`）；链接往往是增量构建中最慢的一步。"

