#: src/foundations/modules.md:3
msgid ""
"C++ organizes code with three unrelated mechanisms: files and `#include` for"
" compilation, namespaces for names, and access specifiers for visibility "
"(plus static libraries, `static` linkage and anonymous namespaces for "
"\"private to this file\"). C++20 modules try to unify them, slowly. Rust has"
" one system: **modules** give you files, namespaces and visibility at once, "
"and **crates** group modules into units of compilation."
msgstr ""
"C++ 用三种互不相关的机制组织代码：文件和 `#include` 负责编译，命名空间负责名字，访问说明符负责可见性（再加上静态库、`static` "
"链接和匿名命名空间来表达“仅本文件可见”）。C++20 的模块试图统一它们，进展缓慢。Rust "
"只有一套系统：**模块**同时提供文件、命名空间和可见性，**crate** 再把模块组合成编译单位。"

