#: src/foundations/modules.md:52
msgid ""
"Everything is **private by default**: to its module and the module's "
"descendants. `pub` makes an item visible to whoever can see the module. "
"Struct fields have their own visibility, so a struct can be public while its"
" fields stay private, which is how types enforce invariants (only the "
"module's own functions can construct or modify them)."
msgstr ""
"一切**默认都是私有的**：只对所在模块及其后代模块可见。`pub` "
"让一个条目对所有能看到该模块的地方可见。结构体字段有各自的可见性，所以结构体可以是公开的而字段保持私有，类型正是这样维护不变量的（只有模块自己的函数能构造或修改它们）。"

