#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:58
msgid ""
"There is no `int`, `long` or `unsigned` whose size depends on the platform. "
"Integer literals default to `i32` and float literals to `f64` when nothing "
"else constrains them. Literals can carry a suffix (`255u8`, `1.0f32`) and "
"underscores (`1_000_000`, `0xFF_FF_FF`)."
msgstr ""
"没有大小随平台变化的 `int`、`long` 或 `unsigned`。在没有其他约束时，整数字面量默认为 `i32`，浮点字面量默认为 "
"`f64`。字面量可以带后缀（`255u8`、`1.0f32`）和下划线（`1_000_000`、`0xFF_FF_FF`）。"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:63
msgid "No implicit conversions"
msgstr "没有隐式转换"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:65
msgid ""
"C++ silently converts between arithmetic types: `int` to `double`, `double` "
"to `float`, `size_t` to `int` (with a warning, if you are lucky), and it "
"promotes small integers to `int` before arithmetic. Rust does none of this. "
"Mixing types is a compile error, and every conversion is spelled out:"
msgstr ""
"C++ 会悄悄地在算术类型之间转换：`int` 转 `double`、`double` 转 `float`、`size_t` 转 "
"`int`（运气好的话会有警告），还会在运算前把小整数提升为 `int`。Rust 一样都不做。混用类型是编译错误，每次转换都必须写出来："

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:74
msgid "// error[E0308]: mismatched types\n"
msgstr "// error[E0308]: 类型不匹配\n"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:78
msgid "The tools for converting:"
msgstr "用于转换的工具："

