#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:150
msgid "Floats"
msgstr "浮点数"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:152
msgid ""
"`f32` and `f64` are IEEE 754, exactly as in C++. Two differences matter:"
msgstr "`f32` 和 `f64` 是 IEEE 754，和 C++ 完全一样。有两点区别值得注意："

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:154
msgid ""
"Floats implement `PartialEq` and `PartialOrd`, but not `Eq` and `Ord`, "
"because `NaN != NaN`. So you cannot sort a `Vec<f32>` with `.sort()` or use "
"`f32` as a `HashMap` key without saying how to handle NaN. Use "
"`v.sort_by(|a, b| a.total_cmp(b))`. The [operators chapter](operators-and-"
"conversions.md) explains these traits."
msgstr ""
"浮点数实现了 `PartialEq` 和 `PartialOrd`，但没有实现 `Eq` 和 `Ord`，因为 `NaN != NaN`。所以你不能用 "
"`.sort()` 对 `Vec<f32>` 排序，也不能在不说明如何处理 NaN 的情况下把 `f32` 用作 `HashMap` 的键。请使用 "
"`v.sort_by(|a, b| a.total_cmp(b))`。[运算符一章](operators-and-"
"conversions.md)解释了这些 trait。"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:159
msgid ""
"There is no `-ffast-math`. The compiler will not reassociate float "
"operations, so it does not auto-vectorize float reductions such as sums. The"
" [SIMD chapter](../engine/math-and-simd.md) shows how to vectorize them "
"yourself."
msgstr ""
"没有 `-ffast-math`。编译器不会重新结合浮点运算，因此不会自动向量化求和这类浮点归约。[SIMD 一章](../engine/math-"
"and-simd.md)介绍了如何自己把它们向量化。"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:164
msgid "Tuples and arrays"
msgstr "元组与数组"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:174
msgid "// a tuple: like std::pair / std::tuple\n"
msgstr "// 元组：类似 std::pair / std::tuple\n"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:178
msgid "// destructuring\n"
msgstr "// 解构\n"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:179
msgid "\"{lo} {hi}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:187
msgid "// 256 zero bytes: [value; count]\n"
msgstr "// 256 个零字节：[值; 个数]\n"

#: src/foundations/values-and-types.md:192
msgid ""
"An **array** `[T; N]` has a fixed length known at compile time and lives "
"inline, like a C array or `std::array<T, N>`. Unlike a C array it never "
"decays to a pointer, it can be passed and returned by value, and indexing is"
" bounds-checked: `identity[4]` with a constant index is a compile error, and"
" with a runtime index it panics instead of reading out of bounds. Arrays of "
"`Copy` types are themselves `Copy`."
msgstr ""
"**数组** `[T; N]` 的长度在编译期固定，数据内联存放，就像 C 数组或 `std::array<T, N>`。与 C "
"数组不同的是，它永远不会退化为指针，可以按值传递和返回，而且索引会做边界检查：用常量索引 `identity[4]` 是编译错误，用运行时索引则会 "
"panic，而不是越界读取。元素为 `Copy` 类型的数组本身也是 `Copy` 的。"

