#: src/foundations/ownership.md:300
msgid ""
"It is not `Copy` and not `Clone`, so it cannot be duplicated. Moves need no "
"code. `Drop` runs exactly once. The `0` sentinel is gone, so the destructor "
"has no `if`. (The `gl` module is stubbed out in a hidden part of the example"
" so it runs in the browser. Click the eye icon to see it. The [OpenGL "
"chapter](../engine/opengl.md) uses the real bindings.)"
msgstr ""
"它不是 `Copy` 也不是 `Clone`，所以不能被复制。移动不需要任何代码。`Drop` 恰好运行一次。`0` "
