"模块替换成了桩代码，这样它能在浏览器中运行。点击眼睛图标即可查看。[OpenGL 一章](../engine/opengl.md)使用了真正的绑定。）"

#: src/foundations/ownership.md:309
msgid ""
"Ownership is a tree: each value has one owner. Engines are full of things "
"that are _not_ trees: a mesh used by many entities, a texture referenced by "
"many materials, a parent and child that point at each other. Rust has three "
"answers, and you will meet all of them:"
msgstr ""
"所有权是一棵树：每个值只有一个所有者。而引擎中到处都是<em>不</em>是树的东西：被许多实体使用的网格、被许多材质引用的纹理、互相指向的父节点和子节点。Rust"
" 有三种应对方式，你都会遇到："

#: src/foundations/ownership.md:314
msgid "**Borrowing** for short-lived access ([next chapter](borrowing.md))."
msgstr "**借用**，用于短期访问（[下一章](borrowing.md)）。"

#: src/foundations/ownership.md:315
msgid ""
"**Shared ownership** with `Rc`/`Arc`, the equivalents of `shared_ptr` "
"([Smart pointers](smart-pointers.md))."
msgstr "**共享所有权**，使用 `Rc`/`Arc`，相当于 `shared_ptr`（[智能指针](smart-pointers.md)）。"

#: src/foundations/ownership.md:317
