"**Handles** into an arena that owns everything, which is usually the best "
"fit for engines ([Handles and arenas](../engine/handles-and-arenas.md))."
msgstr ""
"**句柄**，指向一个拥有所有对象的 arena，这通常是最适合引擎的方式（[句柄与 arena](../engine/handles-and-"
"arenas.md)）。"

#: src/foundations/ownership.md:322
