#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:109
msgid "The bound `S: Shape` is a contract checked in both directions:"
msgstr "约束 `S: Shape` 是一份双向检查的契约："

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:111
msgid ""
"**At the definition**, the body may only use what the bounds promise. "
"Calling `s.perimeter()` inside `total_area` is an error right there, even if"
" no one calls `total_area` yet. C++ templates are checked only when "
"instantiated, and even concepts do not stop a template body from using "
"operations its concept does not mention."
msgstr ""
"**在定义处**，函数体只能使用约束所承诺的东西。在 `total_area` 中调用 `s.perimeter()` 会当场报错，即使还没有人调用 "
"`total_area`。C++ 模板只在实例化时检查，即便是 concept 也阻止不了模板体使用 concept 没有提到的操作。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:116
msgid ""
"**At the call site**, the argument type must implement `Shape`. The error "
"says \"the trait `Shape` is not implemented for `Triangle`\", not three "
"pages of substitution failures."
msgstr ""
"**在调用处**，参数类型必须实现 `Shape`。错误信息会说“the trait `Shape` is not implemented for "
"`Triangle`”（`Triangle` 没有实现 `Shape` trait），而不是三页的替换失败信息。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:120
msgid ""
"Code generation works exactly like templates: the compiler "
"**monomorphizes**, creating a separate copy of `total_area` for each "
"concrete `S`, with `area()` calls resolved statically and usually inlined. "
"There is no run-time cost."
msgstr ""
"代码生成与模板完全相同：编译器会进行**单态化**，为每个具体的 `S` 创建一份 `total_area` 的副本，`area()` "
"调用被静态解析，通常还会被内联。没有运行时开销。"

