#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:175
msgid ""
"Rust has no template specialization (an unstable version exists), no "
"variadic generics, and no SFINAE. Const generics (`struct Matrix<const R: "
"usize, const C: usize>`) cover the most common use of non-type template "
"parameters."
msgstr ""
"Rust 没有模板特化（有一个不稳定的版本）、没有可变参数泛型，也没有 SFINAE。const 泛型（`struct Matrix<const R: "
"usize, const C: usize>`）覆盖了非类型模板参数最常见的用法。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:179
