"To hold _different_ shapes in one collection, you need dynamic dispatch. In "
"Rust that is a **trait object**, `dyn Shape`, always used behind a pointer: "
"`&dyn Shape`, `Box<dyn Shape>`, `Arc<dyn Shape>`."
msgstr ""
"要在一个集合中保存<em>不同的</em>形状，你需要动态分派。在 Rust 中这就是 **trait 对象** `dyn "
"Shape`，它总是放在指针后面使用：`&dyn Shape`、`Box<dyn Shape>`、`Arc<dyn Shape>`。"

