#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:214
msgid ""
"Types pay nothing for traits they might be used through. A `Vec3` can "
"implement ten traits and still be 12 bytes, usable in a GPU buffer."
msgstr ""
"类型不会为可能通过它们来使用的 trait 付出任何代价。一个 `Vec3` 可以实现十个 trait，依然只有 12 字节，可以直接用于 GPU "
"缓冲区。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:216
msgid ""
"The same object can be viewed through different traits at different times, "
"each with its own vtable."
msgstr "同一个对象可以在不同时候通过不同的 trait 来看待，每个 trait 有自己的虚表。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:218
msgid ""
"You can make a trait object out of any type, including `i32` or a type from "
"another crate, without changing it."
msgstr "你可以把任何类型做成 trait 对象，包括 `i32` 或来自其他 crate 的类型，而无需修改它。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:220
msgid ""
"Each `&dyn Trait` is 16 bytes instead of 8. Arrays of trait objects cost "
"twice the pointer memory."
msgstr "每个 `&dyn Trait` 是 16 字节而不是 8 字节。trait 对象数组的指针内存开销是原来的两倍。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:223
msgid ""
"Not every trait can be used as `dyn`. A trait is **dyn-compatible** "
"(formerly \"object safe\") if its methods can be called through a vtable: no"
" generic methods, and no methods returning `Self` by value. The compiler "
"tells you when a trait is not."
msgstr ""
"并不是每个 trait 都能用作 `dyn`。如果一个 trait 的方法都能通过虚表调用，它就是 **dyn "
"兼容的**（以前叫“对象安全”）：没有泛型方法，也没有按值返回 `Self` 的方法。当某个 trait 不满足时，编译器会告诉你。"

#: src/foundations/traits-and-generics.md:228
msgid "Static or dynamic dispatch?"
msgstr "静态分派还是动态分派？"

