"`Vec<Box<dyn System>>`。然后用一个包含这三个系统的 `enum` 重写。如果有 3 个系统你会选哪种？300 个呢？"

#: src/foundations/operators-and-conversions.md:3
msgid ""
"C++ lets you overload almost any operator and define implicit conversions in"
" two directions (converting constructors and conversion operators). Rust "
"allows overloading a fixed set of operators through traits, and has **no "
"implicit conversions** between your types at all. Every conversion is a "
"named call. The result is a little more typing and much less surprise."
msgstr ""
"C++ 允许你重载几乎所有运算符，并在两个方向上定义隐式转换（转换构造函数和转换运算符）。Rust 只允许通过 trait "
"重载一组固定的运算符，而你的类型之间**完全没有隐式转换**。每次转换都是一次具名调用。结果是多打几个字，却少了很多意外。"

#: src/foundations/operators-and-conversions.md:11
