#: src/foundations/collections.md:67
msgid ""
"**Elements move with `memcpy`** on reallocation; there are no move "
"constructors to call and no `noexcept` question."
msgstr "**重新分配时元素用 `memcpy` 移动**；不需要调用移动构造函数，也没有 `noexcept` 的问题。"

#: src/foundations/collections.md:69
msgid ""
"**Indexing is bounds-checked** and panics when out of range. Use `.get(i)` "
"for an `Option`, or iterate to avoid checks entirely. `get_unchecked` exists"
" but is `unsafe`."
msgstr ""
"**索引会做边界检查**，越界时 panic。用 `.get(i)` 得到 `Option`，或者用迭代完全避免检查。`get_unchecked` "
"也有，但它是 `unsafe` 的。"

#: src/foundations/collections.md:72
msgid ""
"**No invalidation bugs**: while you hold a reference into a `Vec`, the "
"compiler will not let you push to it ([Borrowing](borrowing.md))."
msgstr ""
"**没有失效 bug**：当你持有指向 `Vec` 内部的引用时，编译器不会让你向它 push（参见[借用](borrowing.md)）。"

#: src/foundations/collections.md:74
