#: src/foundations/closures-and-iterators.md:238
msgid ""
"Both produce the same vectorized loop. In the indexed version, the compiler "
"proves `i < xs.len()` from the loop bounds and removes the bounds check; in "
"the iterator version there was never a check to remove. When the compiler "
"_cannot_ prove an index is in range (say, `xs[i + offset]`), the indexed "
"version keeps its check and the iterator version (`xs.iter().skip(offset)`, "
"`zip`, `chunks_exact`) is faster."
msgstr ""
"两者生成的是同样的向量化循环。在索引版本中，编译器根据循环边界证明了 `i < "
"xs.len()`，并去掉了边界检查；在迭代器版本中，根本就没有需要去掉的检查。当编译器<em>无法</em>证明索引在范围内时（比如 `xs[i + "
"offset]`），索引版本会保留检查，而迭代器版本（`xs.iter().skip(offset)`、`zip`、`chunks_exact`）会更快。"

#: src/foundations/closures-and-iterators.md:248
msgid ""
"In a debug build (`opt-level = 0`), iterator chains are not inlined and are "
"much slower than raw loops, often by 10 to 50 times. This is the main reason"
" to set `opt-level = 1` for your own code in the dev profile, as shown in "
"the [Cargo chapter](cargo.md)."
msgstr ""
"在调试构建中（`opt-level = 0`），迭代器链不会被内联，比裸循环慢得多，常常慢 10 到 50 倍。这正是在 dev "
"配置中为你自己的代码设置 `opt-level = 1` 的主要原因，参见 [Cargo 一章](cargo.md)。"

