msgstr "`Weak<T>` 与引用循环；"

#: src/foundations/smart-pointers.md:14
msgid "`Cell` and `RefCell`: mutation through a shared reference,"
msgstr "`Cell` 和 `RefCell`：通过共享引用修改数据；"

#: src/foundations/smart-pointers.md:15
