#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:3
msgid ""
"In C++ you choose a test framework (GoogleTest, Catch2, doctest), a "
"benchmark library, a formatter, a linter and a documentation generator, then"
" wire them into CMake. Rust ships with all of them, and every Rust project "
"uses the same ones, so `cargo test` works in any repository you clone."
msgstr ""
"在 C++ "
"中，你要自己选择测试框架（GoogleTest、Catch2、doctest）、基准测试库、格式化工具、静态检查工具和文档生成器，再把它们接进 "
"CMake。Rust 自带了所有这些工具，而且每个 Rust 项目用的都是同一套，所以在你克隆的任何仓库里 `cargo test` 都能直接运行。"

