msgid ""
"Every example in this book is tested the same way: the build runs `mdbook "
"test`, which compiles and runs each one as a doc test."
msgstr "本书的每个示例都以同样的方式测试：构建时会运行 `mdbook test`，把每个示例作为文档测试编译并运行。"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:134
msgid "Benchmarks"
msgstr "基准测试"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:136
msgid ""
"The standard benchmark harness is still unstable, so the community standard "
"is **criterion**, which runs each benchmark enough times for statistically "
"sound results and reports changes against the previous run:"
msgstr ""
"标准的基准测试框架仍未稳定，所以社区的标准做法是 "
"**criterion**：它会把每个基准运行足够多次，以得到统计上可靠的结果，并报告与上一次运行相比的变化："

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:141
msgid ""
"// benches/culling.rs   (with [[bench]] name = \"culling\", harness = false "
"in Cargo.toml)\n"
msgstr ""
"// benches/culling.rs   （需要在 Cargo.toml 中写 [[bench]] name = \"culling\", "
"harness = false）\n"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:148
msgid "\"cull 10k aabbs\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:157
msgid ""
"`cargo bench` runs them. `std::hint::black_box` stops the optimizer from "
"deleting the work, like `benchmark::DoNotOptimize`."
msgstr ""
"用 `cargo bench` 运行它们。`std::hint::black_box` 阻止优化器删掉要测的工作，类似 "
"`benchmark::DoNotOptimize`。"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:160
msgid "Property tests and fuzzing"
msgstr "属性测试与模糊测试"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:162
msgid ""
"**proptest** and **quickcheck** generate random inputs and shrink failures "
"to a minimal case: \"for all vectors `v`, `normalize(v).length()` is 1 or "
"`v` is zero\"."
msgstr ""
"**proptest** 和 **quickcheck** 会生成随机输入，并把失败的用例缩减到最小：“对所有向量 "
"`v`，`normalize(v).length()` 等于 1，或者 `v` 为零”。"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:165
msgid ""
"**cargo-fuzz** runs libFuzzer against a function that takes `&[u8]`. Point "
"it at every parser of untrusted data: asset formats, network packets, save "
"files. Fuzzing safe Rust finds panics and logic bugs; fuzzing unsafe Rust, "
"combined with sanitizers, finds memory bugs."
msgstr ""
"**cargo-fuzz** 用 libFuzzer 测试一个接收 `&[u8]` "
"的函数。把它对准每一个处理不可信数据的解析器：资源格式、网络数据包、存档文件。对安全 Rust 做模糊测试能找出 panic 和逻辑 bug；对 "
"unsafe Rust 做模糊测试并结合 sanitizer，能找出内存 bug。"

