#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:179
msgid ""
"**rustfmt** has one standard style with few options, and almost every Rust "
"project uses it, so all Rust code looks alike. Format on save and stop "
"discussing style."
msgstr ""
"**rustfmt** 只有一种标准风格、选项很少，几乎每个 Rust 项目都在用它，所以所有 Rust "
"代码看起来都差不多。保存时自动格式化，从此不再争论代码风格。"

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:183
msgid ""
"**Clippy** has hundreds of lints, from correctness (`clippy::eq_op`: `x == "
"x`) to performance (`clippy::large_enum_variant`) and style. It is quite "
"good at teaching idiomatic Rust: when it suggests a rewrite, read why. "
"Configure lints in `Cargo.toml`:"
msgstr ""
"**Clippy** 有数百条 lint，涵盖正确性（`clippy::eq_op`：`x == "
"x`）、性能（`clippy::large_enum_variant`）和风格。它很擅长教你写地道的 Rust：当它建议改写时，读一读原因。在 "
"`Cargo.toml` 中配置 lint："

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:188
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[lints.clippy]\n"
"undocumented_unsafe_blocks = \"warn\"\n"
"too_many_arguments = \"allow\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/testing-and-tooling.md:194
msgid ""
"**rustdoc** builds HTML documentation from `///` comments, including your "
"dependencies' documentation, all cross-linked. Every crate on crates.io has "
"its documentation on [docs.rs](https://docs.rs)."
msgstr ""
"**rustdoc** 根据 `///` 注释生成 HTML 文档，也包括你的依赖的文档，全部相互链接。crates.io 上的每个 crate 都在 "
