#: src/systems/logging.md:3
msgid ""
"Every C++ engine has its own logging: `UE_LOG`, a wrapper around spdlog or "
"glog, or a home-grown macro that writes to a file and the in-game console. "
"Third-party libraries each bring their own logging too, and wiring them all "
"into one output is a chore. Rust settled this early. Libraries log through a"
" shared **facade**, and the application chooses, once, where the messages "
"go."
msgstr ""
"每个 C++ 引擎都有自己的日志系统：`UE_LOG`、对 spdlog 或 glog "
"的封装，或者一个自己写的、同时输出到文件和游戏内控制台的宏。第三方库也各自带着自己的日志方式，把它们统一到一个输出里是件苦差事。Rust "
"很早就解决了这个问题：库通过一个共享的**门面**（facade）记录日志，由应用程序决定一次，消息最终去哪里。"

#: src/systems/logging.md:11
msgid "the facade and backend split, and why libraries never pick a backend,"
msgstr "门面与后端的分离，以及为什么库从不选择后端；"

#: src/systems/logging.md:12
msgid "`log` with `env_logger`, and filtering with `RUST_LOG`,"
msgstr "`log` 配合 `env_logger`，以及用 `RUST_LOG` 过滤；"

#: src/systems/logging.md:13
msgid "`tracing`: structured fields and spans, which also feed the profiler,"
msgstr "`tracing`：结构化字段和 span，它们同时也能喂给性能分析器；"

#: src/systems/logging.md:14
msgid ""
"engine needs: log files that do not stall a frame, an in-game console, logs "
"in tests, compile-time filtering,"
msgstr "引擎的需求：不会卡住帧的日志文件、游戏内控制台、测试中的日志、编译期过滤；"

#: src/systems/logging.md:16
msgid "panics: hooks, backtraces and crash reports."
msgstr "panic：钩子、回溯和崩溃报告。"

#: src/systems/logging.md:18
msgid "Facades and backends"
msgstr "门面与后端"

#: src/systems/logging.md:20
msgid ""
"The [`log`](https://docs.rs/log) crate defines macros (`error!`, `warn!`, "
"`info!`, `debug!`, `trace!`), a `Log` trait and one global slot for a "
"logger. It does not print anything. A **backend** crate implements the trait"
" and is installed by `main`. Until a backend is installed, log calls do "
"nothing beyond one check."
msgstr ""
"[`log`](https://docs.rs/log) crate "
"定义了一组宏（`error!`、`warn!`、`info!`、`debug!`、`trace!`）、一个 `Log` "
"trait，以及一个存放日志器的全局槽位。它本身什么都不打印。**后端** crate 实现这个 trait，由 `main` "
"安装。在安装后端之前，日志调用除了一次检查之外什么都不做。"

#: src/systems/logging.md:26
msgid ""
"The whole mechanism fits in a page. This is a simplified `log`, written with"
" the standard library only:"
msgstr "整个机制一页就能写完。下面是一个只用标准库写成的简化版 `log`："

#: src/systems/logging.md:35
msgid "/// The facade: one trait and one global slot.\n"
msgstr "/// 门面：一个 trait 和一个全局槽位。\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:45
msgid "// no backend yet: one check, nothing else\n"
msgstr "// 还没有后端：只做一次检查，别的什么都不做\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:47
msgid "// arguments are formatted only here\n"
msgstr "// 参数只在这里才被格式化\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:58
msgid "// A \"library\" module: it only uses the macros.\n"
msgstr "// 一个\"库\"模块：它只使用这些宏。\n"

