msgstr "// 文件，不带颜色\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:237
msgid "\"logging to the terminal and logs/game.log.<date>\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:241
msgid ""
"The `_guard` is RAII used deliberately: when `main` returns, the guard's "
"`Drop` flushes everything still in the queue. If you drop it early, by "
"writing `let _ = ...` instead of `let _guard = ...`, messages are lost. This"
" is the same mistake as discarding a C++ scope guard."
msgstr ""
"`_guard` 是有意使用的 RAII：`main` 返回时，guard 的 `Drop` 会把队列里剩下的内容全部刷新。如果过早丢弃它，比如写成 "
"`let _ = ...` 而不是 `let _guard = ...`，消息就会丢失。这和在 C++ 里丢掉一个 scope guard "
"是同样的错误。"

#: src/systems/logging.md:246
