msgstr ""
"// `try_`：所有测试共享同一个进程\n"
"    // ...\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:309
msgid "Removing log calls from release builds"
msgstr "从发布构建中移除日志调用"

#: src/systems/logging.md:311
msgid ""
"Both facades can drop verbose levels at compile time, so `trace!` in a hot "
"loop costs nothing in a shipped build:"
msgstr "两个门面都可以在编译期去掉较详细的级别，所以热循环里的 `trace!` 在发布的版本中没有任何开销："

#: src/systems/logging.md:314
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"log = { version = \"0.4\", features = [\"release_max_level_info\"] }\n"
"tracing = { version = \"0.1\", features = [\"release_max_level_info\"] }\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:320
msgid ""
"With these features, `debug!` and `trace!` compile to nothing in release "
"builds, like a `UE_LOG` with a compiled-out verbosity. The arguments are not"
" evaluated either, so do not put side effects in log arguments."
msgstr ""
"启用这些 feature 后，`debug!` 和 `trace!` 在发布构建中会被编译成空，就像编译期关闭了某个详细级别的 "
"`UE_LOG`。参数也不会被求值，所以不要在日志参数里写有副作用的代码。"

#: src/systems/logging.md:324
msgid "Panics and crash reports"
msgstr "panic 与崩溃报告"

#: src/systems/logging.md:326
msgid ""
"A panic in Rust unwinds the thread by default, running destructors, and "
"prints a message to stderr. In a game you want that message, a backtrace and"
" the last log lines in one place. `std::panic::set_hook` replaces the "
"default printer:"
msgstr ""
"Rust 中的 panic 默认会展开（unwind）线程、运行析构函数，并向 stderr "
"打印一条消息。在游戏里，你希望这条消息、回溯和最后几行日志出现在同一个地方。`std::panic::set_hook` 可以替换默认的输出方式："

#: src/systems/logging.md:337
msgid "\"{}:{}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:338
msgid "\"(no message)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:339
msgid ""
"// In a game: tracing::error!(...), flush the log file, write a crash "
"report.\n"
msgstr "// 在游戏中：tracing::error!(...)，刷新日志文件，写入崩溃报告。\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:340
msgid "\"CRASH at {}: {message}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:342
msgid "\"{} backtrace lines\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:345
msgid ""
"// catch_unwind only so that this example keeps running after the panic.\n"
msgstr "// 使用 catch_unwind 只是为了让这个例子在 panic 之后继续运行。\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:348
msgid "// index out of bounds: panics\n"
msgstr "// 索引越界：panic\n"

#: src/systems/logging.md:350
msgid "\"recovered: {}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/logging.md:354 src/systems/networking.md:445
