"laptop. With **trusted publishing**, crates.io accepts a short-lived token "
"from a specific GitHub Actions workflow, so there is no long-lived API token"
" to leak. Publish the first version by hand, enable trusted publishing for "
"the repository and workflow in the crate's settings on crates.io, and then:"
msgstr ""
"对于别人依赖的 crate，应该从 CI 发布，而不是从你的笔记本发布。使用**可信发布**（trusted "
"publishing）时，crates.io 只接受来自指定 GitHub Actions 工作流的短期 token，所以没有可能泄露的长期 API "
"token。先手动发布第一个版本，在 crates.io 上该 crate 的设置中为这个仓库和工作流启用可信发布，然后："

