#: src/systems/concurrency.md:3
msgid ""
"Rust's threads are OS threads, its atomics follow the C++11 memory model, "
"and its mutex is a thin wrapper over the platform's lock. Nothing here is "
"new to you. What is new is that **data races are compile errors**. The same "
"ownership and borrowing rules that prevent use-after-free also prevent two "
"threads from touching the same data without synchronization, and two marker "
"traits, `Send` and `Sync`, extend the rules across threads."
msgstr ""
"Rust 的线程就是操作系统线程，它的原子操作遵循 C++11 "
"内存模型，它的互斥锁是对平台锁的薄包装。这些对你来说都不新鲜。新鲜的是：**数据竞争是编译错误**。防止释放后使用的那套所有权和借用规则，同样能防止两个线程在没有同步的情况下访问同一份数据；而两个标记"
" trait `Send` 和 `Sync` 把这些规则扩展到了线程之间。"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:12
msgid "spawning threads, and scoped threads that can borrow,"
msgstr "创建线程，以及可以借用数据的作用域线程；"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:13
msgid "`Send` and `Sync`,"
msgstr "`Send` 与 `Sync`；"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:14
msgid "`Mutex<T>`: a lock that owns its data,"
msgstr "`Mutex<T>`：拥有其数据的锁；"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:15
msgid "`RwLock`, `Condvar`, atomics and memory ordering,"
msgstr "`RwLock`、`Condvar`、原子操作与内存序；"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:16
msgid "channels,"
msgstr "通道（channel）；"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:17
msgid "data parallelism with rayon, the job system you do not have to write."
msgstr "用 rayon 实现数据并行：一个你不必自己写的任务系统。"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:19
msgid "Spawning threads"
msgstr "创建线程"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:29
msgid "// the thread's return value\n"
msgstr "// 线程的返回值\n"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:39
msgid ""
"`thread::spawn` takes a closure and returns a `JoinHandle`, like "
"`std::thread` returning a future-like handle. The closure must be `'static` "
"(it may outlive the caller), so it must own what it uses: hence `move`. (`||"
" { ... }` is a closure with no parameters, and `move` makes it capture by "
"value; see [Closures](../foundations/closures-and-iterators.md#closures).) A"
" `JoinHandle` that is dropped without `join` **detaches** the thread rather "
"than calling `std::terminate` like an unjoined `std::thread`."
msgstr ""
"`thread::spawn` 接收一个闭包并返回 `JoinHandle`，类似 `std::thread` 返回一个类似 future "
"的句柄。闭包必须是 `'static` 的（它可能比调用者活得更久），所以它必须拥有它使用的东西：因此要写 `move`。（`|| { ... }` "
"是一个没有参数的闭包，`move` 让它按值捕获；参见[闭包](../foundations/closures-and-"
"iterators.md#闭包)。）一个没有 `join` 就被丢弃的 `JoinHandle` 会**分离**（detach）线程，而不是像未 "
"join 的 `std::thread` 那样调用 `std::terminate`。"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:47
msgid "Scoped threads"
msgstr "作用域线程"

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:49
msgid ""
"Often you want threads that work on data owned by the caller and finish "
"before the caller returns, the fork-join pattern. `thread::scope` guarantees"
" all threads spawned inside it are joined at the end of the scope, so they "
"are allowed to **borrow** local data:"
msgstr ""
"你常常需要这样的线程：处理调用者拥有的数据，并在调用者返回之前结束，也就是 fork-join 模式。`thread::scope` 保证在作用域结束时"
" join 其中创建的所有线程，所以这些线程可以**借用**局部数据："

#: src/systems/concurrency.md:62
msgid "// Split the image into 8 horizontal bands, one thread each.\n"
msgstr "// 把图像分成 8 条水平带，每条一个线程。\n"

