#: src/systems/concurrency.md:76
msgid ""
"Each thread gets a `&mut` to a disjoint band from `chunks_mut`, so the "
"borrow checker can see there is no overlap. Try giving two threads the same "
"band and the program will not compile."
msgstr ""
"每个线程都从 `chunks_mut` 拿到指向一条互不相交的带的 "
"`&mut`，所以借用检查器能看出它们没有重叠。试着让两个线程处理同一条带，程序就无法编译。"

