#: src/systems/networking.md:79
msgid "Messages, not byte streams"
msgstr "是消息，而不是字节流"

#: src/systems/networking.md:81
msgid ""
"TCP delivers a stream of bytes, not messages: one `read` can return half a "
"message or three of them. The usual fix is the one you would use in C++: put"
" a length in front of each message. Then the bytes inside the frame must be "
"decoded, and they come from the network, so every length and tag in them is "
"untrusted."
msgstr ""
"TCP 传送的是字节流，而不是消息：一次 `read` 可能只返回半条消息，也可能一次返回三条。常用的解决办法和 C++ "
"里一样：在每条消息前面加上长度。之后还要解码帧里的字节，而这些字节来自网络，所以其中的每个长度和标签都是不可信的。"

