#: src/systems/networking.md:306
msgid ""
"The code has the same shape as the blocking version. The differences that "
"matter to a C++ programmer:"
msgstr "代码结构和阻塞版本一样。对 C++ 程序员来说，重要的区别有这些："

#: src/systems/networking.md:309
msgid ""
"**Futures are lazy.** An `async fn` compiles to a state machine, like a C++ "
"coroutine, but calling it only builds the state machine. Nothing runs until "
"it is `.await`ed or spawned, and the compiler warns about a future you never"
" use."
msgstr ""
"**Future 是惰性的。** `async fn` 会被编译成一个状态机，和 C++ 协程类似，但调用它只会构造出这个状态机。在被 `.await`"
" 或 spawn 之前，什么都不会执行；如果一个 future 从未被使用，编译器会给出警告。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:313
msgid ""
"**The runtime is a library.** The language defines `async`, `.await` and the"
" `Future` trait; the executor and the I/O reactor come from a crate. tokio "
"is the default choice; most networking crates, including tonic and quinn, "
"are built on it."
msgstr ""
"**运行时是一个库。** 语言只定义了 `async`、`.await` 和 `Future` trait，执行器和 I/O reactor 来自 "
"crate。tokio 是默认的选择，包括 tonic 和 quinn 在内的大多数网络 crate 都构建在它之上。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:317
msgid ""
"**`tokio::spawn` needs `Send + 'static`**, for the same reason as "
"`thread::spawn`: the task can move between worker threads and outlive the "
"caller. A future that holds an `Rc`, or a `std::sync::MutexGuard`, across an"
" `.await` is not `Send`, and the spawn is a compile error ([Threads, locks "
"and Send/Sync](concurrency.md))."
msgstr ""
"**`tokio::spawn` 要求 `Send + 'static`**，原因和 `thread::spawn` "
"一样：任务可能在工作线程之间迁移，也可能比调用者活得更久。如果一个 future 跨越 `.await` 持有 `Rc` 或 "
"`std::sync::MutexGuard`，它就不是 `Send` 的，spawn 会编译失败（[线程、锁与 "
"Send/Sync](concurrency.md)）。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:322
msgid ""
"**Never block inside a task.** `std::thread::sleep`, a blocking file read or"
" a long computation stalls every task on that worker thread, just as it "
"would stall an `io_context` thread. Use `tokio::time::sleep`, `tokio::fs`, "
"or move the work to `tokio::task::spawn_blocking` or rayon."
msgstr ""
"**不要在任务里阻塞。** `std::thread::sleep`、阻塞式的文件读取或耗时的计算，会卡住同一个工作线程上的所有任务，就像它会卡住一个 "
"`io_context` 线程一样。请使用 `tokio::time::sleep`、`tokio::fs`，或者把工作交给 "
"`tokio::task::spawn_blocking` 或 rayon。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:326
msgid ""
"**Cancellation is dropping.** Dropping a future cancels it at the `.await` "
"where it is suspended, and the destructors of everything it holds run. "
"`tokio::time::timeout` and `tokio::select!` are built on this. Code between "
"two `.await`s always runs to completion, so keep invariants intact at every "
"`.await`."
msgstr ""
"**取消就是丢弃。** 丢弃一个 future，就会在它挂起的那个 `.await` "
"处取消它，它持有的所有东西的析构函数都会运行。`tokio::time::timeout` 和 `tokio::select!` "
"都建立在这一点之上。两个 `.await` 之间的代码总会完整执行，所以要保证在每个 `.await` 处不变量都成立。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:331
msgid ""
"**Async spreads.** You can only `.await` inside `async` code. At the "
"boundary between synchronous and async code, `Runtime::block_on` runs a "
"future to completion, and channels pass data across."
msgstr ""
"**异步会传染。** 只有在 `async` 代码里才能 `.await`。在同步代码和异步代码的边界上，用 `Runtime::block_on` "
"把一个 future 运行到结束，并通过 channel 传递数据。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:335
msgid "Networking next to the game loop"
msgstr "在游戏循环旁边运行网络"

#: src/systems/networking.md:337
