#: src/systems/networking.md:681
msgid ""
"The handler takes `&self`, not `&mut self`, because requests run "
"concurrently on several worker threads. Shared state therefore needs atomics"
" or a `Mutex`, and the compiler enforces it: the service must be `Send + "
"Sync`. In gRPC C++ the same rule exists, but only in the documentation. The "
"code generator needs `protoc`; install it from your package manager, or add "
"the `protoc-bin-vendored` crate and point `PROTOC` at it in `build.rs`."
msgstr ""
"处理函数接收的是 `&self`，而不是 `&mut self`，因为请求会在多个工作线程上并发执行。因此共享状态需要用原子类型或 "
"`Mutex`，而且编译器会强制这一点：服务必须是 `Send + Sync` 的。gRPC C++ 里也有同样的规则，但只写在文档里。代码生成器需要 "
"`protoc`：可以用包管理器安装，或者添加 `protoc-bin-vendored` crate，并在 `build.rs` 里把 "
"`PROTOC` 指向它。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:691
msgid ""
"**One crate, two binaries.** A dedicated server is usually the game crate "
"built without rendering, using a Cargo feature or a separate binary target "
"([Cargo, crates and the build](../foundations/cargo.md))."
msgstr ""
"**一个 crate，两个二进制。** 专用服务器通常就是去掉渲染部分构建出来的游戏 crate，通过 Cargo feature "
"或单独的二进制目标实现（[Cargo、crate 与构建](../foundations/cargo.md)）。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:694
msgid ""
"**Send handles, not pointers.** Generational handles contain no addresses, "
"so they make good network entity ids ([Handles and "
"arenas](../engine/handles-and-arenas.md))."
msgstr ""
"**发送句柄，而不是指针。** 带代数的句柄不包含地址，所以很适合用作网络实体 id（[用句柄和 Arena "
"代替指针](../engine/handles-and-arenas.md)）。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:697
msgid ""
"**Never trust the client.** Every decoder returns `Result`, every length is "
"checked against a maximum, and every value is validated before it reaches "
"the simulation. Fuzz the decoders."
msgstr ""
"**永远不要信任客户端。** 每个解码器都返回 `Result`，每个长度都要和上限比较，每个值在进入模拟之前都要验证。对解码器做模糊测试。"

#: src/systems/networking.md:700
msgid ""
"**Keep the transport out of the simulation.** Prediction, interpolation and "
"lag compensation belong in gameplay code that runs at a fixed tick. The "
"network thread only moves bytes and messages."
msgstr "**让传输层远离模拟。** 预测、插值和延迟补偿属于以固定 tick 运行的游戏逻辑代码。网络线程只负责搬运字节和消息。"

