#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:3
msgid ""
"Rust compiles through LLVM, the same back end as Clang, so for equivalent "
"code you get equivalent machine code. Performance work in Rust is the "
"performance work you already do: control the layout, keep data contiguous, "
"avoid allocations in the hot path, measure. This chapter shows the Rust "
"spelling of each technique, and the few places where Rust's defaults differ "
"from C++."
msgstr ""
"Rust 通过 LLVM 编译，后端与 Clang 相同，所以对于等价的代码你会得到等价的机器码。Rust "
"中的性能工作就是你已经在做的性能工作：控制布局、保持数据连续、避免在热点路径上分配内存、测量。本章展示每种技巧在 Rust 中的写法，以及 Rust "
"的默认行为与 C++ 不同的少数几个地方。"

