"`unsafe` 的情况下消除它。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:145
msgid ""
"Do not reach for `unsafe { get_unchecked() }` because \"bounds checks are "
"slow\". Look at the assembly first. In practice an iterator or a single "
"`assert!(idx.len() == data.len())` before the loop lets LLVM remove the "
"checks, and you keep the safety net."
msgstr ""
"不要因为“边界检查很慢”就动用 `unsafe { get_unchecked() }`。先看看汇编。实践中，一个迭代器或者循环之前的一句 "
"`assert!(idx.len() == data.len())` 就能让 LLVM 去掉检查，而你保留了安全网。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:154
msgid ""
"Rust has no `new` operator and no hidden allocations in the language: every "
"heap allocation comes from a library type (`Box`, `Vec`, `String`, `Rc`, "
"`HashMap`…). The standard library's allocator is the system `malloc` by "
"default. You can replace it for the whole program, like replacing `operator "
"new`:"
msgstr ""
"Rust 没有 `new` "
"运算符，语言中也没有隐藏的内存分配：每次堆分配都来自某个库类型（`Box`、`Vec`、`String`、`Rc`、`HashMap`……）。标准库的分配器默认是系统的"
" `malloc`。你可以为整个程序替换它，就像替换 `operator new`："

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:161
msgid "// Use mimalloc for every allocation in the program.\n"
msgstr "// 程序中的每次分配都使用 mimalloc。\n"

