"**Bump allocators** (`bumpalo`) for per-frame scratch data, with the borrow "
"checker ensuring nothing outlives the reset ([Handles and "
"arenas](../engine/handles-and-arenas.md))."
msgstr ""
"**bump 分配器**（`bumpalo`）用于每帧的临时数据，借用检查器确保没有任何东西活过重置（[句柄与 "
"arena](../engine/handles-and-arenas.md)）。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:211
msgid "**Pools and slot maps** for objects with individual lifetimes."
msgstr "**对象池和 slot map**，用于各自有独立生命期的对象。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:213
msgid "Inlining and codegen"
msgstr "内联与代码生成"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:215
msgid ""
"Small functions are inlined within a crate automatically. Across crates, "
"non-generic functions are inlined only with LTO or if marked `#[inline]`. "
"Generic functions are always available for inlining, like templates."
msgstr ""
"在一个 crate 内部，小函数会被自动内联。跨 crate 时，非泛型函数只有在启用 LTO 或标记了 `#[inline]` "
"时才会被内联。泛型函数总是可以被内联，就像模板一样。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:218
msgid ""
"`#[inline(always)]` and `#[inline(never)]` are hints with the usual caveats."
" `#[cold]` marks unlikely paths, like `[[unlikely]]`."
msgstr ""
"`#[inline(always)]` 和 `#[inline(never)]` 是提示，有通常的那些注意事项。`#[cold]` "
"标记不太可能执行的路径，类似 `[[unlikely]]`。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:220
msgid ""
"`opt-level = 3`, `lto = \"fat\"` or `\"thin\"`, `codegen-units = 1` and `-C "
"target-cpu=native` in `.cargo/config.toml` are the main build knobs "
"([Cargo](../foundations/cargo.md))."
msgstr ""
"`opt-level = 3`、`lto = \"fat\"` 或 `\"thin\"`、`codegen-units = 1`，以及 "
"`.cargo/config.toml` 中的 `-C target-"
"cpu=native`，是主要的构建调节项（[Cargo](../foundations/cargo.md)）。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:223
msgid "`panic = \"abort\"` removes unwinding tables and landing pads."
msgstr "`panic = \"abort\"` 会去掉展开表和着陆点（landing pad）。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:224
msgid ""
"Profile-guided optimization works via `-C profile-generate` / `-C profile-"
"use` (or the `cargo-pgo` helper)."
msgstr ""
"基于性能分析的优化（PGO）通过 `-C profile-generate` / `-C profile-use` 实现（或使用 `cargo-pgo`"
" 辅助工具）。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:227
msgid "Profiling and reading assembly"
msgstr "性能分析与阅读汇编"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:229
msgid ""
"Your profilers work unchanged; make sure symbols are present in optimized "
"builds:"
msgstr "你的性能分析器无需改动就能使用；只要确保优化构建中带有符号："

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:232
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[profile.release]\n"
"debug = \"line-tables-only\"   # or `true` for full debug info\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
"```toml\n"
"[profile.release]\n"
"debug = \"line-tables-only\"   # 或用 `true` 获得完整的调试信息\n"
"```"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:237
msgid ""
"**Sampling profilers**: perf, VTune, Superluminal, Instruments, Windows "
"Performance Analyzer. `cargo flamegraph` wraps perf/dtrace and produces an "
"SVG flame graph."
msgstr ""
"**采样分析器**：perf、VTune、Superluminal、Instruments、Windows Performance "
"Analyzer。`cargo flamegraph` 包装了 perf/dtrace，可以生成 SVG 火焰图。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:240
msgid ""
"**Instrumented**: Tracy (via `tracy-client` or the `tracing-tracy` layer) "
"and `puffin` for in-game frame profilers."
msgstr ""
"**插桩分析器**：Tracy（通过 `tracy-client` 或 `tracing-tracy` 层），以及用于游戏内帧分析的 `puffin`。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:242
msgid ""
"**Assembly**: `cargo asm` (the `cargo-show-asm` tool) prints the assembly of"
" a single function. The Playground and Compiler Explorer (godbolt.org) show "
"assembly in the browser; every example in this book has a link to open it in"
" the Playground."
msgstr ""
"**汇编**：`cargo asm`（`cargo-show-asm` 工具）可以打印单个函数的汇编。Playground 和 Compiler "
"Explorer（godbolt.org）可以在浏览器中显示汇编；本书的每个示例都有一个在 Playground 中打开它的链接。"

#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:246
msgid ""
"**Benchmarks**: `criterion` for statistically sound microbenchmarks "
"([Testing](testing-and-tooling.md))."
msgstr "**基准测试**：用 `criterion` 做统计上可靠的微基准测试（[测试](testing-and-tooling.md)）。"

