#: src/systems/memory-and-performance.md:266
msgid ""
"Use the counting allocator to find every allocation in a small program that "
"builds strings with `format!` in a loop. Remove them by reusing a `String` "
"with `write!` (from `std::fmt::Write`)."
msgstr ""
