"By convention a crate named `foo-sys` contains only the raw bindings and the"
" linking logic, and a separate `foo` crate wraps them in a safe API. You "
"will see this pattern across the ecosystem: `ash` (Vulkan), `glfw-sys`, "
"`sdl2-sys`, `openxr-sys`."
