"// &mut self: the C library says a world must not be stepped concurrently,\n"
"    // and &mut makes that a compile-time guarantee.\n"
msgstr ""
"// &mut self：C 库规定一个 world 不能被并发地 step，\n"
"    // 而 &mut 把这一点变成了编译期保证。\n"

