msgid "// destroyed exactly once, here\n"
msgstr "// 恰好在这里销毁一次\n"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:200
msgid ""
"The wrapper makes the C API's rules impossible to break: you cannot forget "
"to destroy the world, destroy it twice, use it after destroying it, or step "
"it from two threads at once. Note that `World` is automatically neither "
"`Send` nor `Sync` because it holds a raw pointer; if the C library allows "
"using a world from another thread, you add `unsafe impl Send for World {}` "
"and document why."
msgstr ""
"这个包装层让 C API 的规则无法被违反：你不可能忘记销毁 world、销毁两次、在销毁后使用，或者同时从两个线程 step 它。注意，因为 "
"`World` 持有一个裸指针，它自动既不是 `Send` 也不是 `Sync`；如果 C 库允许在另一个线程中使用 world，你就要加上 "
"`unsafe impl Send for World {}` 并写明理由。"

