"`std::unique_ptr`、`std::shared_ptr`、`std::string`、`std::vector` 以及 "
"`rust::String`/`rust::Vec`/`rust::Slice`。对于大型的现有 C++ API，`autocxx` 可以从头文件生成 "
"cxx 桥接。"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:280
msgid "Rust inside a CMake project"
msgstr "在 CMake 项目中使用 Rust"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:282
msgid ""
"To introduce Rust into an existing C++ engine incrementally, add a Rust "
"crate as a library and let CMake drive Cargo. **Corrosion** does this:"
msgstr ""
"要把 Rust 逐步引入现有的 C++ 引擎，可以把一个 Rust crate 作为库加入，并让 CMake 来驱动 "
"Cargo。**Corrosion** 就是做这件事的："

#: src/systems/ffi.md:285
msgid ""
"```cmake\n"
"include(FetchContent)\n"
"FetchContent_Declare(Corrosion\n"
"    GIT_REPOSITORY https://github.com/corrosion-rs/corrosion.git\n"
"    GIT_TAG v0.5)\n"
"FetchContent_MakeAvailable(Corrosion)\n"
"\n"
"corrosion_import_crate(MANIFEST_PATH rust/asset_tools/Cargo.toml)\n"
"\n"
"add_executable(editor src/main.cpp)\n"
"target_link_libraries(editor PRIVATE asset_tools)   # the Rust staticlib\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/systems/ffi.md:298
msgid ""
"A common first project is a self-contained subsystem with a narrow "
"interface: an asset importer, a file-format parser, a networking layer, or a"
" tool. Those benefit most from Rust's safety (they handle untrusted input) "
"and need the least interop."
msgstr ""
"常见的第一个项目是一个接口很窄、自成一体的子系统：资源导入器、文件格式解析器、网络层或者某个工具。这些部分从 Rust "
"的安全性中获益最多（它们要处理不可信的输入），需要的互操作也最少。"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:303
msgid "Ownership across the boundary"
msgstr "跨越边界的所有权"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:305
msgid ""
"The rules you follow in C APIs still apply, and Rust gives you tools to "
"state them:"
msgstr "你在 C API 中遵循的规则依然适用，而 Rust 给了你表达它们的工具："

#: src/systems/ffi.md:308
msgid ""
"**Memory allocated by Rust must be freed by Rust**, and memory from C by C. "
"Export a `free` function: `Box::into_raw` hands a pointer to C, and "
"`Box::from_raw` in your `xxx_destroy` function takes it back."
msgstr ""
"**由 Rust 分配的内存必须由 Rust 释放**，来自 C 的内存则由 C 释放。导出一个 `free` 函数：`Box::into_raw` "
"把指针交给 C，你的 `xxx_destroy` 函数中的 `Box::from_raw` 再把它收回来。"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:311
msgid ""
"**Strings:** pass `*const c_char` in (borrowed, via `CStr`) and return "
"either a pointer into Rust-owned storage that C must not free, or a "
"`CString` turned into a raw pointer with a matching `free_string` function."
msgstr ""
"**字符串：** 传入时用 `*const c_char`（借用，通过 `CStr`）；返回时，要么返回一个指向 Rust 拥有的存储、C "
"不得释放的指针，要么把 `CString` 转成裸指针返回，并配套一个 `free_string` 函数。"

#: src/systems/ffi.md:314
msgid ""
"**Callbacks with context:** pass a `*mut c_void` user pointer alongside an "
"`extern \"C\" fn`, and cast it back to the right type in the callback."
msgstr ""
"**带上下文的回调：** 在 `extern \"C\" fn` 旁边传一个 `*mut c_void` 用户指针，并在回调中把它转换回正确的类型。"

