"绑定的生命周期参数（`Body<'w>`），并检查先丢弃 world 的代码无法编译。"

#: src/systems/macros.md:3
msgid ""
"The C preprocessor is a text substitution engine that knows nothing about "
"C++: it ignores scopes, evaluates arguments more than once, and produces "
"errors in code you never wrote. C++ programmers learn to minimize it and "
"move what they can into templates and `constexpr`. Rust macros are different"
" in kind. They operate on the syntax tree, they are hygienic (they cannot "
"accidentally capture or shadow your variables), and they are used routinely:"
" `println!`, `vec!`, `format!` and `#[derive]` are all macros."
msgstr ""
"C 预处理器是一个对 C++ 一无所知的文本替换引擎：它无视作用域，会多次求值参数，还会在你从没写过的代码里报错。C++ "
"程序员学会了尽量少用它，能挪到模板和 `constexpr` 里的都挪过去。Rust "
"的宏在本质上就不同。它们作用于语法树，是卫生的（hygienic，不会意外地捕获或遮蔽你的变量），并且被经常使用：`println!`、`vec!`、`format!`"
" 和 `#[derive]` 都是宏。"

#: src/systems/macros.md:13
