#: src/systems/macros.md:168
msgid ""
"Writing your own procedural macro uses the `syn` (parse Rust syntax) and "
"`quote` (generate Rust code) crates. It is worth it for engine-wide "
"patterns, such as deriving editor inspectors or component registration. A "
"complete example, an attribute macro and a derive with its own helper "
"attribute, is in [Declaring your own "
"attributes](../intro/syntax.md#declaring-your-own-attributes)."
msgstr ""
"编写自己的过程宏要用到 `syn`（解析 Rust 语法）和 `quote`（生成 Rust 代码）这两个 "
