#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:46
msgid "Two differences from GLM matter in practice:"
msgstr "与 GLM 相比，有两点区别在实践中很重要："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:48
msgid ""
"**No implicit conversions.** There is no `vec4(v3, 1.0)` constructor "
"overload that silently picks a meaning; you write `v3.extend(1.0)` or "
"`Vec4::from((v3, 1.0))`. `f32` to `f64` is never implicit either."
msgstr ""
"**没有隐式转换。** 没有会悄悄选择某种含义的 `vec4(v3, 1.0)` 构造函数重载；你要写 `v3.extend(1.0)` 或 "
"`Vec4::from((v3, 1.0))`。`f32` 到 `f64` 也从来不是隐式的。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:51
msgid ""
"**Projection conventions are explicit in the name**: `perspective_rh` "
"produces a 0-to-1 depth range (Vulkan, D3D, WebGPU), `perspective_rh_gl` "
"produces -1-to-1 (OpenGL). GLM picks one with a `#define`."
msgstr ""
"**投影约定在名字里写明**：`perspective_rh` 生成 0 到 1 "
"的深度范围（Vulkan、D3D、WebGPU），`perspective_rh_gl` 生成 -1 到 1 的范围（OpenGL）。GLM 则用一个 "
"`#define` 来选择。"

