#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:99
msgid "Laying out data for the GPU"
msgstr "为 GPU 安排数据布局"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:101
msgid ""
"Uniform and vertex buffers are bytes with a layout the shader expects. In "
"C++ you `memcpy` a struct and hope the padding matches. In Rust, the "
"[bytemuck](https://docs.rs/bytemuck) crate lets you turn a struct or slice "
"into `&[u8]` **without `unsafe`**, but only for types that implement `Pod` "
"(\"plain old data\": `#[repr(C)]`, no padding, no pointers, every bit "
"pattern valid). `#[derive(Pod)]` checks those conditions at compile time:"
msgstr ""
"uniform 缓冲区和顶点缓冲区就是一些字节，布局要符合着色器的预期。在 C++ 中，你 `memcpy` 一个结构体，然后祈祷填充一致。在 Rust"
" 中，[bytemuck](https://docs.rs/bytemuck) crate 可以让你**不用 `unsafe`** 就把结构体或切片变成"
" `&[u8]`，但只适用于实现了 `Pod` 的类型（“plain old "
"data”：`#[repr(C)]`、没有填充、没有指针、任何位模式都有效）。`#[derive(Pod)]` 会在编译期检查这些条件："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:124
msgid "// std140: vec3 occupies 16 bytes. Without this field,\n"
msgstr "// std140：vec3 占 16 字节。如果没有这个字段，\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:125
msgid "// derive(Pod) fails: the struct would have tail padding.\n"
msgstr "// derive(Pod) 会失败：结构体末尾会有填充。\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:128
msgid "// zero-copy, safe\n"
msgstr "// 零拷贝，安全\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:132
msgid ""
"If you forget `_pad`, the `#[derive(Pod)]` fails to compile because the "
"struct has padding bytes (reading them would be reading uninitialized "
"memory). This turns a class of \"my uniform is shifted by 4 bytes\" bugs "
"into compile errors. For checking that a Rust struct matches a WGSL or GLSL "
"layout exactly, the [encase](https://docs.rs/encase) and "
"[crevice](https://docs.rs/crevice) crates generate std140/std430 layouts for"
" you."
msgstr ""
"如果你忘了 `_pad`，`#[derive(Pod)]` 就会编译失败，因为结构体有填充字节（读取它们就是在读取未初始化的内存）。这把一类“我的 "
"uniform 偏移了 4 字节”的 bug 变成了编译错误。要检查 Rust 结构体是否与 WGSL 或 GLSL "
"的布局完全一致，[encase](https://docs.rs/encase) 和 "
"[crevice](https://docs.rs/crevice) 这两个 crate 可以为你生成 std140/std430 布局。"

