#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:161
msgid "Auto-vectorization"
msgstr "自动向量化"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:163
msgid ""
"Before writing intrinsics, check what the compiler already does. LLVM "
"vectorizes loops over slices well when it can prove there is no aliasing and"
" no out-of-bounds access, and Rust gives it both more often than C++ does "
"(`&mut` slices are `noalias`; iterators have no bounds checks):"
msgstr ""
"在动手写内建函数之前，先看看编译器已经做了什么。当 LLVM 能证明没有重叠、没有越界访问时，它能很好地向量化遍历切片的循环，而 Rust 比 C++ "
"更常为它提供这两点（`&mut` 切片是 `noalias` 的；迭代器没有边界检查）："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:176
msgid ""
"// Floating-point addition is not associative, so LLVM will not reorder a\n"
"    // plain `.sum()` into SIMD lanes. Accumulating into 8 lanes yourself lets it.\n"
msgstr ""
"// 浮点加法不满足结合律，所以 LLVM 不会把普通的 `.sum()`\n"
"    // 重排到各个 SIMD 通道中。自己累加到 8 个通道就可以了。\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:197
msgid "To see whether a loop vectorized:"
msgstr "要查看一个循环是否被向量化："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:199
msgid ""
"Open the example in the Playground, choose **Release**, then **Show "
"Assembly**, and look for packed instructions (`mulps`, `addps`, "
"`vfmadd...ps` on x86; `fmla v0.4s` on ARM)."
msgstr ""
"在 Playground 中打开示例，选择 **Release**，再选择 **Show Assembly**，寻找打包指令（x86 上的 "
"`mulps`、`addps`、`vfmadd...ps`；ARM 上的 `fmla v0.4s`）。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:202
msgid ""
"Locally, `cargo asm --release mycrate::saxpy` (from `cargo-show-asm`), or "
"Compiler Explorer with `-C opt-level=3`."
msgstr ""
"在本地可以用 `cargo asm --release mycrate::saxpy`（来自 `cargo-show-asm`），或者在 "
"Compiler Explorer 中使用 `-C opt-level=3`。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:204
msgid ""
"Enable wider instructions with `-C target-cpu=native` or `-C target-"
"feature=+avx2,+fma` in `.cargo/config.toml`. Without it, x86-64 code only "
"assumes SSE2, exactly like a default C++ compiler."
msgstr ""
"在 `.cargo/config.toml` 中用 `-C target-cpu=native` 或 `-C target-"
"feature=+avx2,+fma` 启用更宽的指令。否则 x86-64 代码只假定 SSE2，和默认的 C++ 编译器完全一样。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:208
msgid ""
"`chunks_exact(8)` is the idiom that makes the trip count a multiple of the "
"vector width: inside the loop, `c` is known to have length 8, so the inner "
"`c[i]` needs no bounds check."
msgstr ""
"`chunks_exact(8)` 是让循环次数成为向量宽度整数倍的惯用写法：在循环内部，已知 `c` 的长度为 8，所以内层的 `c[i]` "
"不需要边界检查。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:212
msgid "Intrinsics: `core::arch`"
msgstr "内建函数：`core::arch`"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:214
msgid ""
"When you need a specific instruction, the intrinsics are in `std::arch` "
"(alias `core::arch`), under the same names as in Intel's and ARM's headers: "
"`_mm_add_ps`, `_mm256_fmadd_ps`, `vaddq_f32`. They are `unsafe` because "
"calling an AVX2 instruction on a CPU without AVX2 is undefined behavior."
msgstr ""
"当你需要某条特定的指令时，内建函数位于 `std::arch`（别名 `core::arch`）中，名字与 Intel 和 ARM "
"头文件中的相同：`_mm_add_ps`、`_mm256_fmadd_ps`、`vaddq_f32`。它们是 `unsafe` 的，因为在不支持 "
"AVX2 的 CPU 上执行 AVX2 指令是未定义行为。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:219
msgid ""
"The safe pattern has three parts: a function compiled for the feature with "
"`#[target_feature]`, a runtime check with `is_x86_feature_detected!`, and a "
"scalar fallback."
msgstr ""
"安全的模式由三部分组成：一个用 `#[target_feature]` 为该特性编译的函数、一个用 `is_x86_feature_detected!`"
" 进行的运行时检查，以及一个标量回退实现。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:224 src/engine/math-and-simd.md:249
msgid "\"x86_64\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:228
msgid "/// out[i] = a[i] + b[i], 8 lanes at a time, using AVX.\n"
msgstr "/// out[i] = a[i] + b[i]，使用 AVX 一次处理 8 个通道。\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:229 src/engine/math-and-simd.md:250
msgid "\"avx\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:234
msgid ""
"// SAFETY: i + 8 <= n <= len for all three slices (checked above),\n"
"            // and loadu/storeu have no alignment requirement.\n"
msgstr ""
"// SAFETY: 对三个切片都有 i + 8 <= n <= len（已在上面检查），\n"
"            // 并且 loadu/storeu 没有对齐要求。\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:251
msgid "// SAFETY: we just checked that the CPU supports AVX.\n"
msgstr "// SAFETY: 我们刚刚检查过 CPU 支持 AVX。\n"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:268
msgid "Notes for C++ intrinsics users:"
msgstr "给 C++ 内建函数用户的说明："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:270
msgid ""
"`#[target_feature(enable = \"avx\")]` is `__attribute__((target(\"avx\")))`."
" Calling such a function is `unsafe` from code not compiled with that "
"feature, which is what forces the runtime check."
msgstr ""
"`#[target_feature(enable = \"avx\")]` 就是 "
"`__attribute__((target(\"avx\")))`。从没有用该特性编译的代码中调用这样的函数是 `unsafe` "
"的，这正是强制你做运行时检查的原因。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:273
msgid ""
"`is_x86_feature_detected!` caches the CPUID result; the check costs a load "
"and a branch. On ARM, use `std::arch::is_aarch64_feature_detected!`. NEON is"
" always present on AArch64, so most NEON code needs no check."
msgstr ""
"`is_x86_feature_detected!` 会缓存 CPUID 的结果；一次检查的开销是一次加载和一个分支。在 ARM 上用 "
"`std::arch::is_aarch64_feature_detected!`。AArch64 上总是有 NEON，所以大多数 NEON "
"代码不需要检查。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:276
msgid ""
"Inside a `#[target_feature]` function, intrinsics that do not touch memory "
"(`_mm256_add_ps`) are safe to call in recent Rust. Loads and stores through "
"raw pointers still need `unsafe`, with a `SAFETY` comment."
msgstr ""
"在较新的 Rust 中，在 `#[target_feature]` "
"函数内部调用不访问内存的内建函数（`_mm256_add_ps`）是安全的。通过裸指针进行的加载和存储仍然需要 `unsafe`，并附上 "
"`SAFETY` 注释。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:279
msgid ""
"To compile everything for a known baseline instead, set `-C target-"
"cpu=x86-64-v3` (AVX2, FMA) and drop the runtime checks."
msgstr "如果想针对一个已知的基线编译所有代码，可以设置 `-C target-cpu=x86-64-v3`（AVX2、FMA），并去掉运行时检查。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:282
msgid "Portable SIMD"
msgstr "可移植 SIMD"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:284
msgid ""
"`std::simd` provides `f32x4`, `f32x8`, `u8x16` and friends with operators "
"and lane-wise methods, compiled to whatever the target supports. It is the "
"Rust equivalent of `std::experimental::simd` and, like it, is **not yet "
"stable**: it requires a nightly compiler."
msgstr ""
"`std::simd` 提供了 `f32x4`、`f32x8`、`u8x16` 等类型，带有运算符和逐通道的方法，会编译成目标平台支持的任何指令。它是 "
"Rust 版的 `std::experimental::simd`，也和后者一样**尚未稳定**：需要 nightly 编译器。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:294
msgid "// aligned middle part\n"
msgstr "// 对齐的中间部分\n"

