"and `Quat`. For most engine code, the order of preference is:"
msgstr ""
"在稳定版 Rust 上，[wide](https://docs.rs/wide) crate 目前提供了类似的类型（`f32x8`），而 glam "
"已经在 `Vec4`、`Mat4` 和 `Quat` 的内部使用了 SIMD。对于大多数引擎代码，推荐的顺序是："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:307
msgid "Write slice loops the compiler can vectorize, and check the assembly."
msgstr "编写编译器能够向量化的切片循环，并检查汇编。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:308
msgid "Use SIMD-backed types from a library (glam, wide, ultraviolet)."
msgstr "使用库中基于 SIMD 的类型（glam、wide、ultraviolet）。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:309
msgid ""
"Write `core::arch` intrinsics in a small module with runtime detection and "
"`SAFETY` comments."
msgstr "在一个带运行时检测和 `SAFETY` 注释的小模块中编写 `core::arch` 内建函数。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:312
msgid "Floating-point behavior"
msgstr "浮点行为"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:314
msgid ""
"Rust follows IEEE 754 by default and never enables fast-math globally: no "
"reassociation, no flush-to-zero, NaNs and infinities preserved. Some things "
"to know:"
msgstr ""
"Rust 默认遵循 IEEE 754，并且从不全局启用 fast-math：不重新结合，不将非规格化数刷为零，保留 NaN 和无穷大。有几点需要了解："

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:318
msgid ""
"`f32::mul_add` is a fused multiply-add (one rounding). It compiles to an FMA"
" instruction when the target has one, and to a slow software routine when it"
" does not, so enable `+fma` if you use it in hot code."
msgstr ""
"`f32::mul_add` 是融合乘加（只舍入一次）。当目标平台有 FMA 指令时它会编译成 FMA "
"指令，否则会编译成很慢的软件实现，所以如果在热点代码中使用它，请启用 `+fma`。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:321
msgid ""
"`f32::min` and `f32::max` ignore NaN (they return the other operand), unlike"
" `std::min` which depends on argument order. `clamp` panics if `min > max`."
msgstr ""
"`f32::min` 和 `f32::max` 会忽略 NaN（返回另一个操作数），而 `std::min` 的结果取决于参数顺序。如果 `min > "
"max`，`clamp` 会 panic。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:323
msgid ""
"`total_cmp` gives a total order (for sorting floats); `f32` does not "
"implement `Ord`, so `sort()` on a `Vec<f32>` does not compile. Use "
"`v.sort_by(f32::total_cmp)`."
msgstr ""
"`total_cmp` 提供全序（用于对浮点数排序）；`f32` 没有实现 `Ord`，所以对 `Vec<f32>` 调用 `sort()` "
"无法编译。请使用 `v.sort_by(f32::total_cmp)`。"

#: src/engine/math-and-simd.md:326
msgid ""
"Float to integer casts with `as` **saturate**: `300.7f32 as u8 == 255`, "
"`f32::NAN as i32 == 0`. In C++, out-of-range conversion is undefined "
"behavior."
msgstr ""
"用 `as` 把浮点数转换为整数会**饱和**：`300.7f32 as u8 == 255`，`f32::NAN as i32 == 0`。在 C++"
" 中，超出范围的转换是未定义行为。"

