#: src/engine/opengl.md:3
msgid ""
"OpenGL is a C API built on a hidden global: the current context, plus a "
"large state machine of bindings. That makes it the least Rust-shaped "
"graphics API, and therefore a good place to see how Rust code wraps a C API "
"it cannot change. If you have written GL against GLFW and a loader such as "
"glad, everything here will look familiar; the new parts are where ownership "
"and `Drop` replace manual `glDelete*` calls."
msgstr ""
"OpenGL 是一个建立在隐藏全局状态之上的 C API：当前上下文，加上一个由各种绑定组成的庞大状态机。这使它成为最不符合 Rust 风格的图形 "
"API，也正因如此，它是观察 Rust 代码如何封装一个无法修改的 C API 的好地方。如果你用 GLFW 和 glad 之类的加载器写过 "
"GL，这里的一切都会很眼熟；新的部分在于所有权和 `Drop` 取代了手动的 `glDelete*` 调用。"

