#: src/engine/opengl.md:155
msgid "Owning GL objects with `Drop`"
msgstr "用 `Drop` 拥有 GL 对象"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:157
msgid ""
"A GL object name is a resource like a file handle: it must be deleted "
"exactly once, and not used afterwards. That is the definition of an owned "
"type with a `Drop` impl. The one complication is that deleting needs the "
"context, so the wrapper keeps a reference-counted handle to it."
msgstr ""
"GL 对象名和文件句柄一样是一种资源：它必须恰好被删除一次，之后不能再使用。这正是带有 `Drop` "
"实现的拥有型类型的定义。唯一的麻烦是删除需要上下文，所以封装类型保存了一个指向上下文的引用计数句柄。"

