#: src/engine/opengl.md:224
msgid ""
"This is RAII exactly as in a C++ wrapper class, with three differences that "
"remove the usual pitfalls:"
msgstr "这与 C++ 封装类中的 RAII 完全一样，但有三点不同，消除了常见的陷阱："

#: src/engine/opengl.md:227
msgid ""
"**No rule of five.** In C++ a `GlBuffer` class must delete its copy "
"constructor and write a move constructor that zeroes the source, or a copy "
"will double-delete. A Rust struct without `Clone` cannot be copied, and a "
"move leaves nothing behind to drop. The wrapper above is complete."
msgstr ""
"**没有五法则。** 在 C++ 中，`GlBuffer` "
"类必须删除拷贝构造函数，并编写一个把源对象清零的移动构造函数，否则一次拷贝就会导致重复删除。一个没有 `Clone` 的 Rust "
"结构体无法被复制，而移动后不会留下任何需要丢弃的东西。上面的封装已经是完整的。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:231
msgid ""
"**Typed buffers.** `Buffer<u16>` and `Buffer<[f32; 3]>` are different types,"
" so passing the vertex buffer where the index buffer is expected is a "
"compile error, and `len()` counts elements, not bytes."
msgstr ""
"**有类型的缓冲区。** `Buffer<u16>` 和 `Buffer<[f32; 3]>` "
"是不同的类型，因此在需要索引缓冲区的地方传入顶点缓冲区会产生编译错误，而且 `len()` 计数的是元素而不是字节。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:234
msgid ""
"**Thread affinity is checked.** A GL context is current on one thread. The "
"`Rc` inside makes `Buffer` neither `Send` nor `Sync`, so the compiler "
"rejects moving it to a worker thread. In C++, that bug shows up as a driver "
"crash or a silent no-op."
msgstr ""
"**线程亲和性受到检查。** GL 上下文只在一个线程上是当前的。内部的 `Rc` 使 `Buffer` 既不是 `Send` 也不是 "
"`Sync`，所以编译器会拒绝把它移动到工作线程。在 C++ 中，这个 bug 会表现为驱动崩溃或悄无声息的空操作。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:242
msgid ""
"Many engines do not delete GL objects from `Drop` directly, because a drop "
"can happen while the object is still referenced by queued draw calls, or "
"from a thread without the context. The common alternative is a deletion "
"queue: `Drop` pushes the name onto a list owned by the renderer, and the "
"renderer deletes everything in the list at a safe point in the frame. The "
"ownership logic is the same; only the timing changes. [Vulkan](vulkan.md) "
"needs this from the start."
msgstr ""
"许多引擎并不直接在 `Drop` 中删除 GL "
"对象，因为丢弃可能发生在对象仍被排队的绘制调用引用时，或者发生在没有上下文的线程上。常见的替代方案是删除队列：`Drop` "
"把对象名推入渲染器拥有的列表，渲染器在帧中的安全时间点删除列表中的所有对象。所有权逻辑不变，只是时机改变了。[Vulkan](vulkan.md) "
"从一开始就需要这样做。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:252
msgid "The bind-to-edit state machine"
msgstr "先绑定再编辑的状态机"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:254
msgid ""
"GL's global bindings are the part Rust can do least about. `glBindBuffer` "
"changes hidden state that later calls depend on, and nothing in the types "
"records it. The classic bug is a helper that binds something else between "
"your bind and your edit:"
msgstr ""
"GL 的全局绑定是 Rust 最帮不上忙的部分。`glBindBuffer` 会修改隐藏的状态，之后的调用都依赖它，而类型里没有任何记录。典型的 bug"
" 是在你绑定和编辑之间，某个辅助函数绑定了别的东西："

#: src/engine/opengl.md:261
msgid "// A fake GL that keeps the hidden binding, as a real driver does.\n"
msgstr "// 一个模拟的 GL，像真实驱动一样保存隐藏的绑定。\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:268
msgid "\"glBindBuffer(GL_ARRAY_BUFFER, {id})\""
msgstr ""

