msgid "\"glBufferData: {bytes} bytes go to buffer {}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/opengl.md:274
msgid "\"glNamedBufferData({id}): {bytes} bytes go to buffer {id}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/opengl.md:279
msgid "// binds its own buffer and leaves it bound\n"
msgstr "// 绑定自己的缓冲区，并且没有恢复\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:286
msgid "// Bind-to-edit: correct only if nothing binds in between.\n"
msgstr "// 先绑定再编辑：只有中间没有其他绑定时才正确。\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:289
msgid "// goes to buffer 2, not the mesh\n"
msgstr "// 数据写进了缓冲区 2，而不是网格的缓冲区\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:291
msgid ""
"// DSA: the object is an argument, so there is no hidden state to clobber.\n"
msgstr "// DSA：对象作为参数传入，没有可以被改乱的隐藏状态。\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:296
msgid ""
"This compiles in Rust exactly as it does in C++: `&Gl` is a shared reference"
" and the binding lives behind a `Cell`, just as it lives inside the driver. "
"Options, from least to most structure:"
msgstr ""
"这段代码在 Rust 里和在 C++ 里一样能编译通过：`&Gl` 是共享引用，绑定状态藏在 `Cell` "
"后面，就像它藏在驱动内部一样。可选的做法，按结构化程度从低到高："

#: src/engine/opengl.md:300
msgid ""
"**Use DSA (direct state access, GL 4.5).** `glNamedBufferData(id, ...)` "
"takes the object directly, and most of the hidden state disappears. glow "
"exposes these as `named_buffer_data_u8_slice` and friends. If you can "
"require GL 4.5, do this."
msgstr ""
"**使用 DSA（直接状态访问，GL 4.5）。** `glNamedBufferData(id, ...)` "
"直接接收对象，大部分隐藏状态随之消失。glow 将它们暴露为 `named_buffer_data_u8_slice` 等函数。如果你可以要求 GL "
"4.5，就这样做。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:304
msgid ""
"**Re-bind before every use.** Simple, and the driver ignores redundant binds"
" cheaply on most implementations."
msgstr "**每次使用前重新绑定。** 简单，而且在大多数实现中驱动会低成本地忽略冗余绑定。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:306
msgid ""
"**Guards.** A method `buffer.bind(&mut gl_state) -> BoundBuffer<'_>` that "
"borrows a state object mutably. Only one buffer can be bound at a time "
"because only one `&mut` borrow of the state can exist. This encodes the "
"state machine in lifetimes, but it is usually more ceremony than it is worth"
" for GL."
msgstr ""
"**守卫。** 一个方法 `buffer.bind(&mut gl_state) -> "
"BoundBuffer<'_>`，它可变地借用一个状态对象。因为状态对象同时只能存在一个 `&mut` "
"借用，所以同一时间只能绑定一个缓冲区。这用生命周期编码了状态机，但对 GL 来说通常得不偿失。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:312
msgid "Re-binding with a state cache"
msgstr "带状态缓存的重新绑定"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:314
msgid ""
"Option 2 makes every operation self-contained: each method binds what it "
"needs, so it does not matter what ran before. Engines usually put a small "
"cache in front of the bind calls to skip the redundant ones:"
msgstr ""
"做法 2 让每个操作都自成一体：每个方法自己绑定需要的东西，所以之前执行过什么都无所谓。引擎通常会在绑定调用前加一个小缓存，跳过多余的绑定："

#: src/engine/opengl.md:324
msgid "\"  glBindBuffer({id})\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/opengl.md:325
msgid "\"  glBufferData({bytes} bytes)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/opengl.md:327
msgid "/// Owns the context and remembers what is bound.\n"
msgstr "/// 持有上下文，并记住当前绑定了什么。\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:332
msgid "// skip the call if it is already bound\n"
msgstr "// 如果已经绑定，就跳过这次调用\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:342
