#: src/engine/opengl.md:403
msgid ""
"// let mut l = lines.bind(&mut st); // error[E0499]: cannot borrow `st` as\n"
"    // m.data(16);                      // mutable more than once at a time\n"
msgstr ""
"// let mut l = lines.bind(&mut st); // error[E0499]：不能同时多次\n"
"    // m.data(16);                      // 可变借用 `st`\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:406
msgid "// fine: `m` is no longer used\n"
msgstr "// 可以：`m` 之后不再使用\n"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:411
msgid ""
"The bug from the first example cannot be written: `draw_debug_lines` would "
"need `&mut GlState` to bind, and it cannot get one while `m` is alive. The "
"cost shows up quickly in real code. GL has a binding point per target, per "
"texture unit and per vertex array, the element buffer binding is stored "
"inside the bound VAO, and a draw needs several things bound at once, so the "
"guards multiply and their lifetimes appear in every helper's signature."
msgstr ""
"第一个例子里的 bug 在这里写不出来：`draw_debug_lines` 要绑定就需要 `&mut GlState`，而 `m` "
"还活着时它拿不到。但在真实代码里，代价很快就显现出来。GL 的每个目标、每个纹理单元、每个顶点数组都有各自的绑定点，元素缓冲区的绑定保存在当前绑定的 "
"VAO 里，一次绘制又需要同时绑定好几样东西，于是守卫越来越多，它们的生命周期也会出现在每个辅助函数的签名里。"

#: src/engine/opengl.md:418
msgid ""
"In practice, wrap object lifetime (which `Drop` handles completely) and keep"
" the binding calls explicit, with DSA where you can require GL 4.5 and a "
"state cache otherwise. Lifetime bugs are the expensive ones."
msgstr ""
"实际做法是：封装对象的生命周期（`Drop` 能完全处理），绑定调用保持显式；能要求 GL 4.5 时用 DSA，否则用状态缓存。生命周期 bug "
"才是代价高的那一类。"

