#: src/engine/vulkan.md:33
msgid ""
"Almost every call is `unsafe`, because the Vulkan spec lists \"valid usage\""
" rules that a binding cannot check: a buffer must not be destroyed while a "
"command buffer that uses it is pending, an image must be in the right "
"layout, and so on. ash's job is to make the calls convenient and typed; "
"correctness is still on you, plus the validation layers."
msgstr ""
"几乎每个调用都是 `unsafe` 的，因为 Vulkan "
"规范列出了绑定无法检查的\"有效用法\"规则：在使用某个缓冲区的命令缓冲区仍处于挂起状态时，不得销毁该缓冲区；图像必须处于正确的布局；等等。ash "
"的职责是让调用方便且有类型；正确性仍然由你和验证层负责。"

