#: src/engine/vulkan.md:73
msgid "Lifetimes on create-info structs"
msgstr "create-info 结构体上的生命周期"

#: src/engine/vulkan.md:75
msgid ""
"The classic C bug with create-info structs is a dangling pointer: you point "
"`pQueueFamilyIndices` at a temporary array, the array dies, and the call "
"reads garbage. ash's builder structs carry a lifetime parameter, "
"`vk::BufferCreateInfo<'a>`, which records \"this struct borrows something "
"for `'a`\". The compiler then rejects the dangling version."
msgstr ""
"create-info 结构体的经典 C bug 是悬垂指针：你让 `pQueueFamilyIndices` "
"指向一个临时数组，数组消亡了，调用读到的就是垃圾。ash 的构建器结构体带有一个生命周期参数 "
"`vk::BufferCreateInfo<'a>`，它记录了\"这个结构体借用了某些东西，期限为 `'a`\"。于是编译器会拒绝悬垂的版本。"

