#: src/engine/vulkan.md:139
msgid ""
"The same mechanism checks `p_next` chains. In ash, `push_next` takes `&'a "
"mut T` where `T` must implement the marker trait for that chain (for example"
" `ExtendsPhysicalDeviceFeatures2`), so you can only chain structs the spec "
"allows, and they must outlive the struct they extend:"
msgstr ""
"同样的机制也检查 `p_next` 链。在 ash 中，`push_next` 接收 `&'a mut T`，其中 `T` 必须实现该链对应的标记 "
"trait（例如 "
"`ExtendsPhysicalDeviceFeatures2`），所以你只能链接规范允许的结构体，并且它们必须比被扩展的结构体活得更久："

