#: src/engine/wgpu.md:1
msgid "wgpu: a safe, portable GPU API"
msgstr "wgpu：安全、可移植的 GPU API"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:3
msgid ""
"[wgpu](https://wgpu.rs) is a Rust implementation of the WebGPU API. On the "
"desktop it runs on Vulkan, Metal, D3D12 or OpenGL; in the browser it runs on"
" WebGPU (or WebGL2). It is the graphics layer under Bevy, the Firefox WebGPU"
" implementation, and many Rust renderers and tools. For a C++ programmer, "
"think of it as a Vulkan-flavored version of bgfx, sokol_gfx or Dawn, with an"
" API designed in Rust so that misuse that is undefined behavior in Vulkan "
"becomes a compile error or a reported validation error."
msgstr ""
"[wgpu](https://wgpu.rs) 是 WebGPU API 的 Rust 实现。在桌面上它运行于 Vulkan、Metal、D3D12 或"
" OpenGL 之上；在浏览器中运行于 WebGPU（或 WebGL2）之上。它是 Bevy、Firefox 的 WebGPU 实现以及许多 Rust "
"渲染器和工具底层的图形层。对 C++ 程序员来说，可以把它看作 Vulkan 风格的 bgfx、sokol_gfx 或 Dawn，其 API 用 "
"Rust 设计，使得在 Vulkan 中属于未定义行为的误用变成编译错误或被报告的验证错误。"

