#: src/engine/wgpu.md:44
msgid ""
"The last two rows are the big ones. wgpu tracks how each resource is used in"
" each pass and inserts barriers and layout transitions itself, and it keeps "
"every resource alive until the GPU has finished with it. Those are the two "
"largest sources of bugs in hand-written Vulkan, and they disappear. The cost"
" is some CPU overhead for the tracking, and less control over exactly when "
"barriers happen."
msgstr ""
"最后两行是重点。wgpu 跟踪每个资源在每个通道中的使用方式，自行插入屏障和布局转换，并让每个资源一直存活到 GPU 用完为止。这是手写 Vulkan "
"中两个最大的 bug 来源，而它们消失了。代价是跟踪带来的一些 CPU 开销，以及对屏障发生时机的控制更少。"

