#: src/engine/wgpu.md:160
msgid ""
"The wgpu API uses Rust's rules to make several classes of GPU bug impossible"
" or detectable. Three examples."
msgstr "wgpu API 利用 Rust 的规则，使几类 GPU bug 不可能发生或可以被检测到。下面是三个例子。"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:163
msgid ""
"**A render pass borrows its encoder.** `begin_render_pass` takes `&mut "
"CommandEncoder` and returns a `RenderPass<'_>` that keeps that mutable "
"borrow alive. While the pass exists, you cannot record anything else into "
"the encoder or finish it. \"End the render pass before starting a copy\" is "
"enforced by the borrow checker, and \"end\" is simply the end of the pass's "
"scope. Here is the same pattern in miniature:"
msgstr ""
"**渲染通道借用它的编码器。** `begin_render_pass` 接收 `&mut CommandEncoder`，返回一个保持该可变借用存活的"
" "
"`RenderPass<'_>`。只要通道存在，你就不能向编码器录制其他内容，也不能结束它。\"在开始复制之前结束渲染通道\"由借用检查器强制执行，而\"结束\"就是通道作用域的结束。下面是同一模式的缩小版："

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:176
msgid "\"begin {name}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:179
msgid "\"copy\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:184
msgid "\"draw {n}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:188
msgid "\"end\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:196
msgid ""
"// encoder.copy_buffer();   // error: `encoder` is already borrowed by "
"`pass`\n"
msgstr "// encoder.copy_buffer();   // 错误：`encoder` 已被 `pass` 借用\n"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:203
msgid ""
"Uncomment the line and the compiler refuses: the encoder is mutably borrowed"
" by `pass`. In Vulkan, recording a copy inside a render pass is a validation"
" error at best and a GPU hang at worst. (Recent wgpu versions also offer "
"`pass.forget_lifetime()` for code that needs to store passes, and then check"
" this at run time instead.)"
msgstr ""
"取消这行的注释，编译器就会拒绝：编码器正被 `pass` 可变借用。在 Vulkan 中，在渲染通道内录制复制操作，好一点是验证错误，坏一点是 GPU "
"挂起。（较新的 wgpu 版本还为需要存储通道的代码提供了 `pass.forget_lifetime()`，此时改为在运行时检查这一点。）"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:209
msgid ""
"**Handles are reference counted.** `Buffer`, `Texture`, `BindGroup` and the "
"rest are cheap-to-clone handles to reference-counted objects. Dropping your "
"`Buffer` while a submitted command buffer still uses it is fine: wgpu keeps "
"it alive until that submission completes, then frees it. This is the "
"deletion queue from the [Vulkan chapter](vulkan.md), built in."
msgstr ""
"**句柄是引用计数的。** `Buffer`、`Texture`、`BindGroup` "
"等都是指向引用计数对象的、克隆成本很低的句柄。在已提交的命令缓冲区仍在使用时丢弃你的 `Buffer` 是没问题的：wgpu "
"会让它一直存活到那次提交完成，然后再释放。这就是 [Vulkan 一章](vulkan.md)中的删除队列，只不过是内置的。"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:215
msgid ""
"**`Device` and friends are `Send + Sync`.** You can create resources and "
"record command encoders on worker threads, then submit from one. The type "
"system says which objects can cross threads, so a parallel renderer needs no"
" \"which thread owns the context?\" documentation."
msgstr ""
"**`Device` 等类型是 `Send + Sync`。** "
"你可以在工作线程上创建资源并录制命令编码器，然后在一个线程上提交。类型系统说明了哪些对象可以跨线程，所以并行渲染器不需要\"哪个线程拥有上下文？\"之类的文档。"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:220
msgid ""
"What wgpu does _not_ catch at compile time (wrong buffer usage flags, bind "
"groups that do not match the pipeline layout, out-of-bounds draws) it "
"catches at run time with validation, as an error you can handle or a panic "
"with a readable message, never as undefined behavior. That is the guarantee:"
" **safe wgpu code cannot cause UB on the GPU**, even with wrong arguments."
msgstr ""
"wgpu "
"在编译时<em>没有</em>捕获的问题（错误的缓冲区用途标志、与管线布局不匹配的绑定组、越界绘制），会在运行时通过验证捕获，表现为你可以处理的错误或带有可读信息的"
" panic，绝不会是未定义行为。这就是它的保证：**安全的 wgpu 代码不会在 GPU 上引发未定义行为**，即使参数错误也一样。"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:226
msgid "Uniforms and bind groups"
msgstr "uniform 与绑定组"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:228
msgid ""
"Uniform data goes into a buffer, and a bind group connects buffers and "
"textures to a shader's `@group(n) @binding(m)` slots. The CPU-side struct "
"must match WGSL's layout rules, which you check with `bytemuck` and `const` "
"assertions (see [Math and SIMD](math-and-simd.md)):"
msgstr ""
"uniform 数据放在缓冲区中，绑定组把缓冲区和纹理连接到着色器的 `@group(n) @binding(m)` 槽位。CPU 端的结构体必须符合 "
"WGSL 的布局规则，你可以用 `bytemuck` 和 `const` 断言来检查（见[数学与 SIMD](math-and-simd.md)）："

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:237
msgid "// mat4x4<f32>\n"
msgstr "// mat4x4<f32>\n"

