msgid "// vec3<f32>: 16-byte aligned in WGSL\n"
msgstr "// vec3<f32>：在 WGSL 中按 16 字节对齐\n"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:243
msgid "// for create_buffer_init\n"
msgstr "// 用于 create_buffer_init\n"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:255
msgid "// Each frame: update and bind.\n"
msgstr "// 每一帧：更新并绑定。\n"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:269
msgid ""
"`queue.write_buffer` is the easy path for small, frequent updates: wgpu "
"copies the data into a staging area and schedules the copy before the next "
"submission, so you do not manage staging buffers or worry about overwriting "
"data the GPU is reading."
msgstr ""
"`queue.write_buffer` 是小而频繁更新的简单途径：wgpu "
"把数据复制到暂存区，并在下一次提交前安排复制，因此你无需管理暂存缓冲区，也不用担心覆盖 GPU 正在读取的数据。"

