#: src/engine/wgpu.md:287
msgid ""
"naga validates every shader when the module is created and reports errors "
"with the source span, so a typo is a clean error at load time with the line "
"underlined. The naga command-line tool (`cargo install naga-cli`) converts "
"between WGSL, SPIR-V, GLSL, HLSL and MSL, which is handy for inspecting what"
" your shader becomes on each back end."
msgstr ""
"naga 在创建模块时验证每个着色器，并报告带源码位置的错误，因此一个拼写错误在加载时就是一条干净的错误，且对应行带有下划线标记。naga "
"命令行工具（`cargo install naga-cli`）可以在 WGSL、SPIR-V、GLSL、HLSL 和 MSL "
"之间转换，方便查看你的着色器在各个后端上变成了什么。"

#: src/engine/wgpu.md:293
msgid ""
"For hot-reloading shaders during development, load the WGSL from disk "
"instead of `include_str!` and recreate the pipeline when the file changes "
"([Hot reloading](hot-reload-and-plugins.md)). Use `device.push_error_scope` "
"/ `pop_error_scope` around module creation to turn validation errors into a "
"`Result` instead of a panic, so a broken shader does not end the session."
msgstr ""
"开发期间要热重载着色器，可以从磁盘加载 WGSL 而不是用 `include_str!`，并在文件变化时重建管线（[热重载](hot-reload-"
"and-plugins.md)）。在模块创建周围使用 `device.push_error_scope` / "
"`pop_error_scope`，把验证错误变成 `Result` 而不是 panic，这样一个坏掉的着色器不会结束整个会话。"

