#: src/engine/openxr.md:3
msgid ""
"OpenXR is the Khronos standard API for virtual and augmented reality: "
"headsets (Meta Quest, Valve Index, Pico, Varjo), their controllers, hand "
"tracking, and the compositor that shows your rendered images in the headset."
" Like Vulkan, it is a C API with a loader, extensions and explicit handles, "
"and it is usually used _together_ with Vulkan (or D3D11/12, OpenGL): OpenXR "
"provides the poses, timing and swapchain images; your renderer draws into "
"them."
msgstr ""
"OpenXR 是 Khronos 制定的虚拟现实与增强现实标准 API：涵盖头显（Meta Quest、Valve "
"Index、Pico、Varjo）、它们的控制器、手部追踪，以及把你渲染的图像显示在头显中的合成器。和 Vulkan "
"一样，它是一个带有加载器、扩展和显式句柄的 C API，并且通常与 Vulkan（或 "
"D3D11/12、OpenGL）<em>一起</em>使用：OpenXR 提供姿态、时序和交换链图像；你的渲染器负责往里绘制。"

