"With the real crate, the event loop at the top of each frame looks like "
"this:"
msgstr "使用真正的 crate 时，每帧开头的事件循环如下："

#: src/engine/openxr.md:228
msgid ""
"`poll_event` borrows `event_buffer`, and the returned `xr::Event<'_>` "
"borrows it in turn. In C, the event structure is overwritten by the next "
"`xrPollEvent`, and reading a stale one is a silent bug; here, holding an "
"event across the next poll is a borrow error."
msgstr ""
"`poll_event` 借用 `event_buffer`，返回的 `xr::Event<'_>` 又借用了它。在 C 中，事件结构体会被下一次 "
"`xrPollEvent` 覆盖，读取过期的事件是一个无声的 bug；在这里，跨越下一次轮询持有事件是一个借用错误。"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:233
msgid "The frame loop"
msgstr "帧循环"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:235
msgid ""
"Each frame has three steps. `wait` blocks until the runtime wants a new "
"frame and returns the **predicted display time**, the moment the frame will "
"appear in the headset. You render for that time, not for \"now\":"
msgstr ""
"每一帧有三步。`wait` "
"会阻塞，直到运行时需要新的一帧，并返回**预测显示时间**，即这一帧出现在头显中的时刻。你为那个时刻渲染，而不是为\"现在\"："

#: src/engine/openxr.md:241
msgid ""
"// 1. Throttle to the headset's refresh rate and get the predicted display "
"time.\n"
msgstr "// 1. 按头显刷新率节流，并获取预测显示时间。\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:243
msgid "// 2. Tell the compositor we are starting to render.\n"
msgstr "// 2. 告诉合成器我们开始渲染了。\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:248
msgid "// Not visible (e.g. headset off): submit an empty frame.\n"
msgstr "// 不可见（例如头显已摘下）：提交一个空帧。\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:252
msgid "// Where are the eyes going to be at display time?\n"
msgstr "// 在显示时刻，眼睛会在哪里？\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:255
msgid ""
"// Get a swapchain image to render into (one image with 2 array layers, one "
"per eye).\n"
msgstr "// 获取一张用于渲染的交换链图像（一张图像，2 个数组层，每只眼睛一层）。\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:259
msgid "// your Vulkan code\n"
msgstr "// 你的 Vulkan 代码\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:261
msgid ""
"// 3. Hand the image to the compositor, with the poses we rendered with.\n"
msgstr "// 3. 把图像交给合成器，并附上我们渲染时使用的姿态。\n"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:283
msgid ""
"Why are `FrameWaiter` and `FrameStream` separate objects? OpenXR allows "
"`xrWaitFrame` to be called on one thread while another thread calls "
"`xrBeginFrame`/`xrEndFrame` for the previous frame; that pipelining is how "
"engines hide CPU latency. The crate gives each half its own owned value, "
"both `Send`, and both methods take `&mut self`. So you can move the waiter "
"to a different thread from the stream, but you cannot call `wait` from two "
"threads at once. The spec's \"externally synchronized\" rules become "
"ownership, exactly like command pools in the [Vulkan chapter](vulkan.md)."
msgstr ""
"为什么 `FrameWaiter` 和 `FrameStream` 是分开的对象？OpenXR 允许在一个线程上调用 "
"`xrWaitFrame`，同时另一个线程为上一帧调用 `xrBeginFrame`/`xrEndFrame`；引擎就是靠这种流水线来隐藏 CPU "
"延迟的。crate 给每一半分配各自拥有的值，两者都是 `Send`，并且两者的方法都接收 `&mut self`。所以你可以把 waiter 移到与 "
"stream 不同的线程，但不能同时从两个线程调用 `wait`。规范中的\"外部同步\"规则变成了所有权，与 [Vulkan "
"一章](vulkan.md)中的命令池完全一样。"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:292
msgid ""
"The swapchain follows the same idea: `acquire_image`, `wait_image` and "
"`release_image` take `&mut self`, so two threads cannot interleave them on "
"one swapchain."
msgstr ""
"交换链遵循同样的思路：`acquire_image`、`wait_image` 和 `release_image` 接收 `&mut "
"self`，所以两个线程不能在同一个交换链上交错调用它们。"

