#: src/engine/openxr.md:343
msgid "From FOV and pose to matrices"
msgstr "从 FOV 和姿态到矩阵"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:345
msgid ""
"OpenXR describes each eye with a **pose** (position plus orientation "
"quaternion, in the space you asked for) and an **asymmetric field of view**:"
" four angles in radians, left and down negative. Your renderer needs a view "
"matrix and a projection matrix. This is the part every XR renderer writes, "
"and it is plain math you can run here."
msgstr ""
"OpenXR "
"用一个**姿态**（位置加朝向四元数，位于你请求的空间中）和一个**非对称视场角**来描述每只眼睛：四个以弧度表示的角度，左和下为负。你的渲染器需要一个视图矩阵和一个投影矩阵。这是每个"
" XR 渲染器都要写的部分，而且是可以在这里运行的普通数学。"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:351
msgid ""
"The projection follows the OpenXR SDK's `xr_linear.h`, for Vulkan or wgpu "
"clip space (y pointing down, depth from 0 to 1):"
msgstr ""
"投影遵循 OpenXR SDK 的 `xr_linear.h`，针对 Vulkan 或 wgpu 的裁剪空间（y 朝下，深度从 0 到 1）："

