#: src/engine/openxr.md:503
msgid ""
"**Loader**: Quest uses the Khronos standard Android loader. Enable the "
"crate's `linked` feature and ship `libopenxr_loader.so` in the APK, or use "
"`Entry::load()` and bundle it as a library."
msgstr ""
