"`libopenxr_loader.so`，或者使用 `Entry::load()` 并把它作为库打包；"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:506
msgid ""
"**App glue**: the [android-activity](https://docs.rs/android-activity) crate"
" provides the `android_main` entry point and the lifecycle events (winit "
"uses it on Android too). OpenXR needs the Java VM and activity pointers on "
"Android: pass them through `xr::Entry::initialize_android_loader()` and the "
"session's Android create info, as the crate's examples show."
msgstr ""
"**应用胶水层**：[android-activity](https://docs.rs/android-activity) crate 提供 "
"`android_main` 入口点和生命周期事件（winit 在 Android 上也使用它）。在 Android 上，OpenXR 需要 Java "
"VM 和 activity 指针：像 crate 的示例那样，通过 `xr::Entry::initialize_android_loader()` "
"和会话的 Android create info 传入；"

#: src/engine/openxr.md:511
msgid ""
"**Packaging**: [xbuild](https://github.com/rust-mobile/xbuild) or `cargo-"
"apk` builds the APK; add the VR intent categories and the "
"`com.oculus.intent.category.VR` (and the Khronos "
"`org.khronos.openxr.intent.category.IMMERSIVE_HMD`) to the manifest."
msgstr ""
