#: src/engine/game-loop.md:1
msgid "The game loop, windowing and global state"
msgstr "游戏循环、窗口与全局状态"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:3
msgid ""
"A C++ game's `main` usually looks like this: create a window with SDL or "
"GLFW, then `while (!quit) { poll events; update; render; }`, with the "
"engine's subsystems reachable through singletons. Rust changes two of those "
"pieces. The standard windowing crate, winit, owns the loop and calls you, "
"rather than you calling it. And singletons are mostly replaced by passing "
"context explicitly, because mutable global state is exactly what the borrow "
"checker is designed to control."
msgstr ""
"C++ 游戏的 `main` 通常是这样的：用 SDL 或 GLFW 创建一个窗口，然后 `while (!quit) { poll events; "
"update; render; }`，引擎的各个子系统通过单例访问。Rust 改变了其中两部分。标准的窗口 crate winit "
"拥有循环并调用你，而不是由你调用它。单例则大多被显式传递上下文取代，因为可变的全局状态正是借用检查器要管控的东西。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:13
msgid "winit's event loop and the `ApplicationHandler` trait,"
msgstr "winit 的事件循环与 `ApplicationHandler` trait；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:14
msgid "creating windows: attributes, DPI, fullscreen and multiple windows,"
msgstr "创建窗口：属性、DPI、全屏与多窗口，"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:15
msgid ""
"how winit handles each platform, and how a window reaches the graphics API,"
msgstr "winit 如何处理各个平台，以及窗口如何接入图形 API，"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:16
msgid "a fixed timestep with interpolation,"
msgstr "带插值的固定时间步长；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:17
msgid "frame pacing and vsync,"
msgstr "帧节奏与垂直同步；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:18
msgid "where global state goes when there are no singletons."
msgstr "没有单例时，全局状态该放在哪里。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:20
msgid "winit: the loop calls you"
msgstr "winit：循环调用你"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:22
msgid ""
"winit is the Rust equivalent of the windowing half of GLFW or SDL: windows, "
"input, DPI, and the platform event loop, on Windows, macOS, Linux (X11 and "
"Wayland), Android, iOS and the web. Since version 0.30, you implement a "
"trait and hand it to the event loop:"
msgstr ""
"winit 相当于 GLFW 或 SDL 中负责窗口的那一半在 Rust 中的对应物：窗口、输入、DPI 以及平台事件循环，支持 "
"Windows、macOS、Linux（X11 和 Wayland）、Android、iOS 和 Web。从 0.30 版本开始，你实现一个 trait"
" 并把它交给事件循环："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:37
msgid "// renderer + world, created once we have a window\n"
msgstr "// 渲染器 + 世界，在拿到窗口后创建\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:41
msgid ""
"// Called when the app may create windows (at startup; again after suspend "
"on mobile).\n"
msgstr "// 在应用可以创建窗口时调用（启动时；在移动端从挂起恢复后会再次调用）。\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:55
msgid "// update + render\n"
msgstr "// 更新 + 渲染\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:56
msgid "// ask for the next one\n"
msgstr "// 请求下一帧\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:65
msgid "// run continuously, like a game\n"
msgstr "// 像游戏一样持续运行\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:70
msgid ""
"Why the inversion? Some platforms (macOS, iOS, the web) do not let a program"
" own the main loop: the OS calls the application. winit adopts that model "
"everywhere, so the same code runs on all of them. In practice it changes "
"little: `RedrawRequested` is your \"frame\" callback, and calling "
"`request_redraw()` at the end of each frame keeps it running."
msgstr ""
"为什么要反转？有些平台（macOS、iOS、Web）不允许程序拥有主循环：由操作系统调用应用程序。winit "
"在所有平台上都采用这种模型，所以同一份代码可以在所有平台上运行。实践中这改变不大：`RedrawRequested` "
"就是你的\"帧\"回调，在每帧结束时调用 `request_redraw()` 就能让它持续运行。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:76
msgid ""
"All state lives in the `App` struct. There are no globals; the event loop "
"owns `App`, and each callback gets `&mut self`. That is the start of the "
"answer to \"where does global state go\", which this chapter returns to "
"below."
msgstr ""
"所有状态都存放在 `App` 结构体中。没有全局变量；事件循环拥有 `App`，每个回调拿到的是 `&mut "
"self`。这正是\"全局状态该放在哪里\"这个问题答案的开端，本章后面会再回到这一点。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:80
msgid ""
"If you prefer the C++ shape, the `sdl3` and `glfw` crates are bindings to "
"the libraries you know, with a classic `poll_events()` loop."
msgstr ""
"如果你更喜欢 C++ 的写法，`sdl3` 和 `glfw` 这两个 crate 是对你熟悉的库的绑定，提供经典的 `poll_events()` "
"循环。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:83
msgid "Creating windows"
msgstr "创建窗口"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:85
msgid ""
"`ActiveEventLoop::create_window` is the only way to create a window in "
"winit, and an `ActiveEventLoop` exists only inside a callback. That is "
"deliberate: on Android, iOS and the web, a window cannot exist until the "
"platform has started the application, so winit makes it impossible to create"
" one too early. Create your windows in `resumed`, which every platform calls"
" once the app is ready."
msgstr ""
"在 winit 中，`ActiveEventLoop::create_window` 是创建窗口的唯一方式，而 `ActiveEventLoop` "
"只存在于回调内部。这是有意为之：在 Android、iOS 和 Web 上，平台启动应用之前窗口根本不能存在，所以 winit "
"让你无法过早地创建窗口。请在 `resumed` 中创建窗口，每个平台都会在应用准备就绪后调用它。"

