msgid ""
"winit knows nothing about OpenGL, Vulkan or wgpu, and the graphics crates "
"know nothing about winit. They meet through the small [`raw-window-"
"handle`](https://docs.rs/raw-window-handle) crate, which defines an enum of "
"native handles (`HWND`, `NSView`, Wayland and X11 surfaces, Android "
"`ANativeWindow`, a web canvas). winit implements its `HasWindowHandle` and "
"`HasDisplayHandle` traits, and graphics crates accept anything that does:"
msgstr ""
"winit 对 OpenGL、Vulkan 和 wgpu 一无所知，图形 crate 也对 winit 一无所知。它们通过小巧的 [`raw-"
"window-handle`](https://docs.rs/raw-window-handle) crate 衔接，这个 crate "
"定义了一个原生句柄的枚举（`HWND`、`NSView`、Wayland 与 X11 surface、Android 的 "
"`ANativeWindow`、Web canvas）。winit 实现了它的 `HasWindowHandle` 和 "
"`HasDisplayHandle` trait，而图形 crate 接受任何实现了这些 trait 的类型："

