#: src/engine/game-loop.md:255 src/engine/case-study.md:195
msgid "Fixed timestep"
msgstr "固定时间步长"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:257
msgid ""
"Physics and gameplay usually update at a fixed rate, decoupled from the "
"display. The accumulator pattern (\"Fix your timestep!\") translates "
"directly:"
msgstr "物理和游戏逻辑通常以固定频率更新，与显示解耦。累加器模式（\"Fix your timestep!\"）可以直接翻译过来："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:278
msgid "// clamp, so a long stall does not cause a spiral of death\n"
msgstr "// 限制上限，避免一次长时间卡顿导致死亡螺旋\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:282
msgid ""
"/// Returns how many fixed steps to run this frame, and the interpolation "
"factor.\n"
msgstr "/// 返回本帧要运行多少个固定步长，以及插值系数。\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:302
msgid "// Simulated frame times: a 144 Hz display with one 40 ms hitch.\n"
msgstr "// 模拟的帧时间：144 Hz 显示器，其中有一次 40 毫秒的卡顿。\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:311
msgid "\"frame {ms:>4} ms: {steps} steps, alpha {alpha:.2}, render pos {:.4}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:316
msgid "In a real loop, `frame_time` comes from `std::time::Instant`:"
msgstr "在真正的循环中，`frame_time` 来自 `std::time::Instant`："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:320
msgid "// Instant - Instant = Duration\n"
msgstr "// Instant - Instant = Duration\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:324
msgid ""
"`Instant` is monotonic (`QueryPerformanceCounter`, "
"`clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC)`) and `Duration` is an exact integer number "
"of nanoseconds, so there is no accumulated floating-point drift in the "
"accumulator. Convert to `f32` seconds only at the point of use."
msgstr ""
"`Instant` 是单调的（`QueryPerformanceCounter`、`clock_gettime(CLOCK_MONOTONIC)`），而"
" `Duration` 是精确的整数纳秒数，所以累加器中不会积累浮点漂移。只在使用时才转换为 `f32` 秒。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:329
msgid "Frame pacing"
msgstr "帧节奏"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:331
msgid ""
"**Vsync** is a surface setting, not a loop setting: `PresentMode::Fifo` in "
"wgpu, `VK_PRESENT_MODE_FIFO_KHR` in Vulkan, the swap interval in glutin. "
"Presenting blocks until a vsync slot is available, which paces the loop."
msgstr ""
"**垂直同步**是表面（surface）的设置，而不是循环的设置：wgpu 中的 `PresentMode::Fifo`，Vulkan 中的 "
"`VK_PRESENT_MODE_FIFO_KHR`，glutin 中的交换间隔。呈现操作会阻塞到有可用的垂直同步槽位，从而为循环定速；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:334
msgid ""
"**Without vsync**, `ControlFlow::WaitUntil(next_frame_instant)` tells winit "
"to sleep until the next frame is due, rather than spinning at 100% CPU."
msgstr ""
"**不开垂直同步时**，`ControlFlow::WaitUntil(next_frame_instant)` 告诉 winit "
"睡眠到下一帧到期，而不是以 100% CPU 空转；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:336
msgid ""
"**For tools and editors** that only need to redraw on input, use "
"`ControlFlow::Wait` and call `request_redraw()` only when something changes."
" The event loop then sleeps, like a normal desktop application."
msgstr ""
"**对于只需在输入时重绘的工具和编辑器**，使用 `ControlFlow::Wait`，只在有变化时调用 "
"`request_redraw()`。此时事件循环会睡眠，就像普通的桌面应用。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:339
msgid ""
"`std::thread::sleep` has the usual OS granularity (about 1 ms on Linux and "
"macOS; on Windows, Rust requests high-resolution timers where available). "
"For precise frame caps, sleep until slightly before the deadline, then spin."
msgstr ""
"`std::thread::sleep` 具有通常的操作系统粒度（Linux 和 macOS 上约 1 毫秒；在 Windows 上，Rust "
"会在可用时请求高精度计时器）。要精确限制帧率，先睡眠到截止时间之前一点，然后自旋等待。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:343
msgid "Where global state goes"
msgstr "全局状态该放在哪里"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:345
msgid ""
"C++ engines are full of singletons: `Renderer::Get()`, `g_Input`, "
"`AssetManager::Instance()`. Rust makes mutable globals deliberately awkward:"
" a `static mut` can only be accessed in `unsafe` code, and taking a "
"reference to one is rejected by default in the 2024 edition, because two "
"`&mut` to the same global from different call sites (or threads) is "
"undefined behavior. The idiomatic options, in order of preference:"
msgstr ""
"C++ 引擎里到处是单例：`Renderer::Get()`、`g_Input`、`AssetManager::Instance()`。Rust "
"故意让可变全局变量用起来别扭：`static mut` 只能在 `unsafe` 代码中访问，而且在 2024 edition "
"中，获取它的引用默认会被拒绝，因为从不同调用点（或线程）对同一个全局变量取得两个 `&mut` 是未定义行为。惯用的做法，按优先顺序排列："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:352
msgid "1. Pass a context"
msgstr "1. 传递上下文"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:354
msgid ""
"Most \"global\" state is really per-game state that you can own in one "
"struct and pass down:"
msgstr "大多数\"全局\"状态其实是每个游戏一份的状态，你可以把它放在一个结构体中拥有，并向下传递："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:374
msgid "\"jump.wav\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:389
msgid "\"frame {}: y = {:.3}, sounds = {:?}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:393
msgid ""
"Every dependency is visible in the signature: `Player::update` reads input "
"and time and writes audio. The compiler checks that nothing else holds `&mut"
" Audio` during the call, and tests can construct a `Ctx` with fake input. "
"This is the same idea as ECS resources (`Res<Time>`, `ResMut<Audio>` in "
"bevy_ecs; see [ECS](ecs.md)), which are a context struct managed by the "
"scheduler."
msgstr ""
"每个依赖都在签名中可见：`Player::update` 读取输入和时间，写入音频。编译器会检查在调用期间没有别的东西持有 `&mut "
"Audio`，测试也可以用假输入构造一个 `Ctx`。这与 ECS 资源（bevy_ecs 中的 "
"`Res<Time>`、`ResMut<Audio>`；见 [ECS](ecs.md)）是同一个思路，后者就是由调度器管理的上下文结构体。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:399
msgid "2. Immutable globals, initialized once"
msgstr "2. 只初始化一次的不可变全局变量"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:401
msgid ""
"Configuration, lookup tables and other values that never change after "
"startup can be globals safely, because shared read-only access cannot race:"
msgstr "配置、查找表以及其他启动后不再改变的值，可以安全地作为全局变量，因为共享只读访问不会产生竞争："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:412
msgid "\"loading config (once)\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:413 src/engine/game-loop.md:421
msgid "\"gravity\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:413 src/engine/game-loop.md:421
msgid "\"fov\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:416
msgid "// Fully compile-time tables need no initialization at all:\n"
msgstr "// 完全在编译期计算的表根本不需要初始化：\n"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:426
msgid ""
"`OnceLock` is the thread-safe \"initialize on first use\" of a C++ function-"
"local `static`, and `LazyLock` is the same with the initializer stored in "
"the static itself: `static TABLE: LazyLock<Vec<u32>> = "
"LazyLock::new(build_table);`."
msgstr ""
"`OnceLock` 是线程安全的\"首次使用时初始化\"，相当于 C++ 函数内的 `static`；`LazyLock` "
"与之相同，只是把初始化函数存放在 static 本身中：`static TABLE: LazyLock<Vec<u32>> = "
"LazyLock::new(build_table);`。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:430
msgid "3. Mutable globals, synchronized"
msgstr "3. 带同步的可变全局变量"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:432
msgid ""
"For the few things that really are process-wide and mutable (a logger, a "
"profiler, an allocation counter), wrap them in a synchronization type:"
msgstr "对于少数确实是进程级且可变的东西（日志器、性能分析器、分配计数器），把它们包装在同步类型中："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:435
msgid ""
"**Atomics** for counters and flags: `static FRAMES: AtomicU64 = "
"AtomicU64::new(0);`"
msgstr "**原子类型**用于计数器和标志：`static FRAMES: AtomicU64 = AtomicU64::new(0);`；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:436
msgid ""
"**`Mutex`/`RwLock`** for anything bigger: `static LOG: Mutex<Vec<String>> = "
"Mutex::new(Vec::new());` (`Mutex::new` is `const`, so no lazy initialization"
" is needed)."
msgstr ""
"**`Mutex`/`RwLock`** 用于更大的东西：`static LOG: Mutex<Vec<String>> = "
"Mutex::new(Vec::new());`（`Mutex::new` 是 `const` 的，因此不需要延迟初始化）；"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:438
msgid ""
"**`thread_local!`** for per-thread state, such as a per-thread scratch "
"allocator: `thread_local! { static SCRATCH: RefCell<Vec<u8>> = "
"RefCell::new(Vec::new()); }`"
msgstr ""
"**`thread_local!`** 用于每线程状态，例如每线程的临时分配器：`thread_local! { static SCRATCH: "
"RefCell<Vec<u8>> = RefCell::new(Vec::new()); }`。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:441
msgid ""
"The `log` and `tracing` crates are built this way: a global logger set once "
"at startup, called from anywhere with `log::info!(...)` ([Logging and "
"diagnostics](../systems/logging.md))."
msgstr ""
"`log` 和 `tracing` crate 就是这样构建的：在启动时设置一次全局日志器，然后在任何地方用 `log::info!(...)` "
"调用（[日志与诊断](../systems/logging.md)）。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:448
msgid ""
"Do not reach for `static mut` to port a singleton. If a piece of state is "
"mutated from many places, the Rust answer is to make those places receive it"
" as a parameter. This is often a large refactor in a C++ codebase, but in a "
"new Rust codebase it is the default and costs nothing, and it makes the data"
" flow visible, which is what you need when you later parallelize."
msgstr ""
"不要为了移植单例而去用 `static mut`。如果一份状态在很多地方被修改，Rust 的答案是让这些地方以参数形式接收它。在 C++ "
"代码库中这往往是一次大规模重构，但在新的 Rust 代码库中这是默认做法，不需要任何代价，而且它让数据流变得可见，这正是你以后做并行化时所需要的。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:456
msgid "Input handling"
msgstr "输入处理"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:458
msgid ""
"winit delivers input as events. Games usually convert them into a per-frame "
"state snapshot that update code reads:"
msgstr "winit 以事件的形式传递输入。游戏通常把它们转换为一份每帧的状态快照，供更新代码读取："

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:476
