#: src/engine/game-loop.md:501
msgid ""
"In winit, keys arrive as `KeyEvent { physical_key, logical_key, state, "
"repeat, .. }`. Use `physical_key` (a `KeyCode` like `KeyCode::KeyW`, by "
"position) for WASD movement so it works on AZERTY keyboards, and "
"`logical_key` for text and shortcuts. For gamepads, use the "
"[gilrs](https://docs.rs/gilrs) crate."
msgstr ""
"在 winit 中，按键以 `KeyEvent { physical_key, logical_key, state, repeat, .. }` "
"的形式到达。WASD 移动使用 `physical_key`（按位置区分的 `KeyCode`，如 `KeyCode::KeyW`），这样在 "
"AZERTY 键盘上也能正常工作；文本和快捷键使用 `logical_key`。手柄请使用 [gilrs](https://docs.rs/gilrs)"
" crate。"

#: src/engine/game-loop.md:510
msgid "SDL / GLFW window and loop"
msgstr "SDL / GLFW 窗口与循环"

