#: src/engine/ui.md:3
msgid ""
"A C++ engine typically has three kinds of UI: Dear ImGui for debug overlays "
"and quick tools, Qt or a custom framework for the editor, and a separate "
"system (custom, or middleware such as RmlUi or Noesis) for the in-game HUD "
"and menus. Rust has answers for all three, but the most common C++ design "
"for retained UI does not carry over directly, and understanding why makes "
"the Rust options easy to choose between."
msgstr ""
"C++ 引擎通常有三类 UI：用于调试覆盖层和快速工具的 Dear ImGui，用于编辑器的 Qt 或自研框架，以及用于游戏内 HUD "
"和菜单的另一套系统（自研，或 RmlUi、Noesis 之类的中间件）。Rust 对这三类都有对应方案，但 C++ 中最常见的保留模式 UI "
"设计无法直接照搬。理解其中的原因之后，在 Rust 的几种方案之间做选择就很容易了。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:12
msgid "why callback-based widget trees fight the borrow checker,"
