#: src/engine/ui.md:119
msgid ""
"`Slider::new(&mut self.intensity, ...)` borrows the field only for that "
"call, exactly like `ImGui::SliderFloat(\"intensity\", &intensity, 0, 10)`. "
"The click is handled where the button is drawn, with full `&mut self` "
"access, so there is no callback to store and nothing to share. The costs are"
" also the same as Dear ImGui: layout is computed in one pass each frame, so "
"some layouts need workarounds, and the UI code runs every frame (eframe only"
" repaints on input by default, so an idle tool uses no CPU)."
msgstr ""
"`Slider::new(&mut self.intensity, ...)` 只在这次调用期间借用这个字段，与 "
"`ImGui::SliderFloat(\"intensity\", &intensity, 0, 10)` "
"完全一样。点击在绘制按钮的地方处理，可以完整地访问 `&mut self`，所以没有需要存储的回调，也没有需要共享的东西。代价也与 Dear ImGui"
" 相同：布局每帧只计算一遍，所以有些布局需要变通处理，而且 UI 代码每帧都会运行（eframe 默认只在有输入时重绘，所以空闲的工具不占用 CPU）。"

