#: src/engine/ui.md:225
msgid ""
"`on_event` reports whether egui consumed an event, so the game ignores "
"clicks and key presses that land on a debug window, which is the same check "
"as `io.WantCaptureMouse` in Dear ImGui. The closure passed to `draw` borrows"
" `world` and `renderer` mutably for the duration of the call, so tweaking "
"engine values from the overlay needs no globals."
msgstr ""
"`on_event` 报告 egui 是否消费了某个事件，这样游戏就会忽略落在调试窗口上的点击和按键，这与 Dear ImGui 中检查 "
"`io.WantCaptureMouse` 相同。传给 `draw` 的闭包在调用期间可变地借用 `world` 和 "
"`renderer`，所以从覆盖层调整引擎参数不需要任何全局变量。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:231 src/engine/ui.md:635 src/appendix/cheat-sheet.md:155
msgid "Dear ImGui"
msgstr "Dear ImGui"

#: src/engine/ui.md:233
msgid ""
"egui is a Rust redesign of the same idea, not a port. If your C++ tools are "
"already built on Dear ImGui, you can keep the library itself: your team "
"keeps the API it knows, and you keep docking, multi-viewport and the "
"extensions around it (ImPlot, ImGuizmo, node editors)."
msgstr ""
"egui 是用 Rust 对同一思路的重新设计，而不是移植。如果你的 C++ 工具已经基于 Dear ImGui "
"构建，你可以继续使用这个库本身：团队保留熟悉的 API，你也保留停靠、多视口以及它周边的扩展（ImPlot、ImGuizmo、节点编辑器）。"

