"The closure borrows `game` mutably, so the widgets inside can change it."
msgstr ""
"**Begin/End 配对变成作用域。** `ui.window(...).build(|| ...)` 会调用 "
"`Begin`，仅在窗口可见时运行闭包，然后调用 `End`。闭包可变地借用 `game`，所以其中的控件可以修改它。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:349
msgid ""
"**Push/Pop pairs become tokens.** `push_id`, `push_style_color`, "
"`begin_table`, `tree_node` and the other paired calls return a token that "
"calls the matching `Pop` or `End` when it is dropped, like a C++ RAII guard."
" A missing `PopID()` or an early `return` between `Begin` and `End`, which "
"trip Dear ImGui's assertions in C++, cannot happen. `begin_table` returns "
"`Option<TableToken>` because `BeginTable` can return false, and `if let` "
"enters the block only when there is a table to fill."
msgstr ""
"**Push/Pop 配对变成 token。** "
"`push_id`、`push_style_color`、`begin_table`、`tree_node` 以及其他成对的调用都会返回一个 "
"token，它在被 drop 时调用对应的 `Pop` 或 `End`，就像 C++ 中的 RAII guard。在 C++ 中会触发 Dear "
"ImGui 断言的错误，比如漏掉 `PopID()`，或者在 `Begin` 和 `End` 之间提前 "
"`return`，在这里都不会发生。`begin_table` 返回 `Option<TableToken>`，因为 `BeginTable` 可能返回"
" false，而 `if let` 只在确实有表格需要填充时才进入代码块。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:356
msgid ""
"**Name the token.** `let _id = ui.push_id(i);` keeps the ID pushed until the"
" end of the block. `let _ = ui.push_id(i);` drops the token immediately and "
"pops the ID on the same line, which is a silent bug. The underscore prefix "
"is what you want: unused, but alive."
msgstr ""
"**给 token 起个名字。** `let _id = ui.push_id(i);` 会让 ID 一直保持压入状态，直到代码块结束。`let _ ="
" ui.push_id(i);` 则会立即 drop 这个 token，在同一行就把 ID 弹出，这是一个不会报错的 "
"bug。你需要的是下划线前缀：不使用，但保持存活。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:360
msgid ""
"**Strings are `&str`.** Labels and `ui.text` take Rust strings, and "
"`ui.input_text(\"name\", &mut name).build()` edits a `String` directly "
"instead of a fixed `char[256]` buffer. Use `format!` where C++ uses printf-"
"style formatting."
msgstr ""
"**字符串是 `&str`。** 标签和 `ui.text` 接受 Rust 字符串，`ui.input_text(\"name\", &mut "
"name).build()` 直接编辑一个 `String`，而不是固定大小的 `char[256]` 缓冲区。C++ 中用 printf "
"风格格式化的地方，在 Rust 中用 `format!`。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:365
msgid "The frame in your engine"
msgstr "在你的引擎中运行一帧"

#: src/engine/ui.md:367
msgid ""
"The integration has the same three hooks as in C++: forward events, start a "
"frame, and render the draw data into your pass. With winit and wgpu (surface"
" and device setup as in [Portable graphics with wgpu](wgpu.md)):"
msgstr ""
"集成方式与 C++ 中一样有三个挂钩点：转发事件、开始一帧、把绘制数据渲染到你的渲染通道中。使用 winit 和 wgpu 时（surface "
"和设备的设置见[使用 wgpu 实现跨平台图形](wgpu.md)）："

#: src/engine/ui.md:375
msgid "// In `resumed`, after creating the window, device and surface:\n"
msgstr "// 在 `resumed` 中，创建窗口、设备和 surface 之后：\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:377
msgid "// colors picked in the UI are sRGB\n"
msgstr "// UI 中选取的颜色是 sRGB\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:397
msgid "// 1. Every event goes to ImGui first.\n"
msgstr "// 1. 每个事件都先交给 ImGui。\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:402
msgid "// CloseRequested and Resized as in the game loop chapter\n"
msgstr "// CloseRequested 和 Resized 的处理与游戏循环一章相同\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:404
msgid "// the click is not on an ImGui window: pass it to the game\n"
msgstr "// 点击没有落在 ImGui 窗口上：交给游戏处理\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:407
msgid "// 2. Start the frame and build the UI.\n"
msgstr "// 2. 开始一帧并构建 UI。\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:419
msgid "// 3. Render the game, then ImGui into the same pass.\n"
msgstr "// 3. 先渲染游戏，再把 ImGui 渲染到同一个通道中。\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:429
msgid "// ... draw the game ...\n"
msgstr "// ……绘制游戏……\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:448
msgid "A few things the types enforce here:"
msgstr "这里有几件事是由类型保证的："

#: src/engine/ui.md:450
msgid ""
"**The `Ui` borrows the context.** `imgui.frame()` returns a `&mut Ui` tied "
"to the `Context`, so calling `gpu.imgui.render(...)` ends the frame, and "
"using `ui` after that is a compile error (E0499: `gpu.imgui` is borrowed "
"mutably twice). In C++, calling a widget function after `ImGui::Render()` is"
" an assertion at run time."
msgstr ""
"**`Ui` 借用了上下文。** `imgui.frame()` 返回一个与 `Context` 绑定的 `&mut Ui`，所以调用 "
"`gpu.imgui.render(...)` 会结束这一帧，之后再使用 `ui` 就是编译错误（E0499：`gpu.imgui` "
"被可变借用了两次）。在 C++ 中，在 `ImGui::Render()` 之后调用控件函数只会在运行时触发断言。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:455
msgid ""
"**Disjoint borrows.** `debug_window(ui, &mut self.game)` borrows `self.game`"
" while `gpu` borrows `self.gpu`. The compiler accepts this because they are "
"different fields of `self`, so the UI can edit game state directly, with no "
"globals and no `Rc<RefCell<...>>`."
msgstr ""
"**不相交的借用。** `debug_window(ui, &mut self.game)` 借用 `self.game`，同时 `gpu` 借用的是 "
"`self.gpu`。编译器接受这种写法，因为它们是 `self` 的不同字段，所以 UI 可以直接修改游戏状态，不需要全局变量，也不需要 "
"`Rc<RefCell<...>>`。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:459
msgid ""
"**Input capture.** `io().want_capture_mouse()` and `want_capture_keyboard()`"
" are the same flags as `io.WantCaptureMouse` and `io.WantCaptureKeyboard` in"
" C++."
msgstr ""
"**输入捕获。** `io().want_capture_mouse()` 和 `want_capture_keyboard()` 就是 C++ 中的 "
"`io.WantCaptureMouse` 和 `io.WantCaptureKeyboard`。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:462
msgid ""
"**Color space.** Dear ImGui's colors are sRGB values. The example renders to"
" a non-sRGB view of the swapchain so that the clear color and the color "
"picker match. If you render to an sRGB target, the renderer converts the UI "
"colors for you (`GammaMode::Auto`), and your own clear color must be linear."
msgstr ""
"**颜色空间。** Dear ImGui 的颜色是 sRGB 值。示例渲染到交换链的非 sRGB "
"视图上，这样清屏颜色和颜色选择器显示的颜色一致。如果你渲染到 sRGB 目标上，渲染器会替你转换 UI "
"颜色（`GammaMode::Auto`），而你自己的清屏颜色必须是线性值。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:467
msgid "Docking, viewports and extensions"
msgstr "停靠、视口与扩展"

#: src/engine/ui.md:469
msgid ""
"Docking is enabled with `ConfigFlags::DOCKING_ENABLE` before the first "
"frame, as above. `ui.dockspace()` with `PASSTHRU_CENTRAL_NODE` turns the "
"whole main window into a dock area whose empty center shows the game, which "
"is the usual layout for an in-engine editor. Multi-viewport (dragging ImGui "
"windows out of the main window into OS windows) is a cargo feature, `dear-"
"imgui-wgpu/multi-viewport-winit`, because the backend then has to create "
"winit windows and wgpu surfaces for you."
msgstr ""
"停靠功能需要在第一帧之前通过 `ConfigFlags::DOCKING_ENABLE` 启用，如上所示。带 "
"`PASSTHRU_CENTRAL_NODE` 的 `ui.dockspace()` "
"会把整个主窗口变成一个停靠区域，空出的中央区域显示游戏画面，这是引擎内编辑器的常见布局。多视口（把 ImGui "
"窗口拖出主窗口，变成独立的操作系统窗口）是一个 cargo feature，即 `dear-imgui-wgpu/multi-viewport-"
"winit`，因为这时后端需要替你创建 winit 窗口和 wgpu surface。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:477
msgid ""
"The extensions are separate crates on the same release train, so keep their "
"versions in step:"
msgstr "扩展是同一发布系列中的独立 crate，所以要让它们的版本保持一致："

#: src/engine/ui.md:480
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"dear-implot = \"0.23\"     # ImPlot: frame time graphs, profiler views\n"
"dear-imguizmo = \"0.23\"   # ImGuizmo: translate/rotate/scale gizmos in the viewport\n"
"dear-imnodes = \"0.23\"    # ImNodes: node graphs for materials or behavior trees\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:486
msgid ""
"They follow the same rules as the core: begin/end pairs are closures or "
"tokens, and values you edit are passed as `&mut`."
msgstr "它们遵循与核心库相同的规则：begin/end 配对是闭包或 token，要编辑的值以 `&mut` 传入。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:489
msgid "iced: messages and an update function"
msgstr "iced：消息与 update 函数"

#: src/engine/ui.md:491
msgid ""
"[iced](https://docs.rs/iced) follows the Elm architecture. The state is a "
"plain struct. `view` builds widgets from a shared borrow of the state, and "
"widgets do not change anything: they produce **messages**. The runtime then "
"calls `update` with a mutable borrow to apply each message:"
msgstr ""
"[iced](https://docs.rs/iced) 遵循 Elm 架构。状态是一个普通的结构体。`view` "
"通过状态的共享借用构建控件，而控件本身不修改任何东西：它们产生**消息**。随后运行时用一个可变借用调用 `update`，逐条应用这些消息："

#: src/engine/ui.md:496
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"iced = \"0.14\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:526
msgid "\"Intensity: {:.1}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:529
msgid "\"Baked {} times\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:541
msgid ""
"![The iced light panel: an intensity label, a slider, a Bake button and a "
"\"Baked 0 times\" label](img/ui-iced.png)"
msgstr ""
"![iced 灯光面板：一个强度标签、一个滑块、一个 Bake 按钮和一个“Baked 0 times”标签](img/ui-iced.png)"

#: src/engine/ui.md:543
msgid ""
"All mutation happens in one function, one message at a time, so there is "
"never more than one mutable borrow of the state and the borrow checker has "
"nothing to object to. `Message` is an ordinary enum, so adding a new "
"interaction is a compile error until `update` handles it. This scales well "
"to editors with many panels, and it makes UI behavior easy to test: call "
"`update` with messages and check the state."
msgstr ""
"所有修改都在一个函数中进行，一次处理一条消息，所以状态的可变借用永远不会超过一个，借用检查器也就无可挑剔。`Message` "
"是一个普通的枚举，所以新增一种交互后，在 `update` 处理它之前都会编译报错。这种方式能很好地扩展到有许多面板的编辑器，也让 UI "
"行为易于测试：用消息调用 `update`，然后检查状态。"

#: src/engine/ui.md:550
msgid "Slint: a declarative language"
msgstr "Slint：声明式语言"

#: src/engine/ui.md:552
msgid ""
"[Slint](https://slint.dev) describes the UI in its own language, close to "
"QML, with properties, bindings and callbacks. The `slint!` macro compiles it"
" at build time (it can also live in `.slint` files):"
msgstr ""
"[Slint](https://slint.dev) 用它自己的语言描述 UI，这种语言接近 QML，有属性、绑定和回调。`slint!` "
"宏在构建时编译它（它也可以放在 `.slint` 文件中）："

#: src/engine/ui.md:556
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"slint = \"1.19\"\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:563
msgid "\"1.19\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:564
msgid "\"std-widgets.slint\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:572
msgid "\"Intensity: \""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:581
msgid "// a weak handle: the closure must not keep the UI alive\n"
msgstr "// 弱句柄：闭包不能让 UI 一直存活\n"

#: src/engine/ui.md:584
msgid "\"bake at intensity {:.1}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/ui.md:590
msgid ""
"![The Slint light panel: \"Intensity: 4\", a slider and a Bake "
"button](img/ui-slint.png)"
msgstr "![Slint 灯光面板：“Intensity: 4”、一个滑块和一个 Bake 按钮](img/ui-slint.png)"

#: src/engine/ui.md:592
msgid ""
"The `<=>` binding keeps the slider and the property in sync without any Rust"
" code. The callback captures a **weak** handle, so it does not keep the UI "
"alive: this is the Rust version of the `[weak = QPointer(this)]` pattern in "
"Qt. Slint also targets embedded devices and has a visual designer, which "
"makes it a good fit for editor and launcher UIs designed by non-programmers."
" It is dual-licensed (GPLv3, a royalty-free license for desktop, mobile and "
"web applications, or a paid license), so check the terms for your product."
msgstr ""
"`<=>` 绑定让滑块和属性保持同步，不需要任何 Rust 代码。回调捕获的是一个**弱**句柄，所以不会让 UI 一直存活：这就是 Qt 中 "
"`[weak = QPointer(this)]` 模式的 Rust 版本。Slint "
"也支持嵌入式设备，并且有可视化设计器，因此很适合由非程序员设计的编辑器和启动器 UI。它采用多重许可（GPLv3、适用于桌面、移动和 Web "
"应用的免版税许可，或付费许可），请根据你的产品核对条款。"

