#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:1
msgid "Assets, build scripts and serialization"
msgstr "资源、构建脚本与序列化"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:3
msgid ""
"A C++ engine's build is more than compiling C++: shaders are compiled to "
"SPIR-V or DXIL, textures are compressed, meshes are converted, and code is "
"generated from schemas, all wired into CMake with `add_custom_command`. At "
"run time, an asset manager loads the results, often on worker threads, and "
"reloads them when they change. This chapter covers the Rust equivalents."
msgstr ""
"C++ 引擎的构建不只是编译 C++：着色器被编译为 SPIR-V 或 DXIL，纹理被压缩，网格被转换，代码根据模式文件生成，这一切都用 "
"`add_custom_command` 接入 CMake。运行时，资源管理器加载这些结果，通常在工作线程上进行，并在它们变化时重新加载。本章介绍 "
"Rust 中的对应做法。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:11
msgid "`build.rs` build scripts for shader compilation and code generation,"
msgstr "用于着色器编译和代码生成的 `build.rs` 构建脚本；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:12
msgid "embedding files in the binary,"
msgstr "把文件嵌入二进制；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:14
msgid "an asset cache with typed handles and background loading,"
msgstr "带有类型化句柄和后台加载的资源缓存；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:15
msgid "watching files for hot reload,"
msgstr "监视文件以实现热重载；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:16
msgid "organizing an engine as a Cargo workspace."
msgstr "把引擎组织为 Cargo 工作空间。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:18
msgid "Build scripts"
msgstr "构建脚本"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:20
msgid ""
"A file named `build.rs` in a package root is compiled and run by Cargo "
"**before** the package itself is compiled. It is ordinary Rust, so it can do"
" anything: run a compiler, generate code, compile a C library with the `cc` "
"crate (see [FFI](../systems/ffi.md)). It talks to Cargo by printing "
"`cargo::` lines to stdout."
msgstr ""
"包根目录下名为 `build.rs` 的文件会在包本身编译**之前**由 Cargo 编译并运行。它是普通的 Rust "
"代码，所以可以做任何事：运行编译器、生成代码、用 `cc` crate 编译 C 库（见 [FFI](../systems/ffi.md)）。它通过向 "
"stdout 打印 `cargo::` 开头的行与 Cargo 通信。"

