#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:99
msgid ""
"Embedded data needs no file I/O and no path handling at run time, which "
"makes it ideal for default assets, fonts, shaders and small tools. For large"
" asset sets, load from disk so you can change assets without rebuilding."
msgstr ""
"嵌入的数据在运行时不需要文件 "
"I/O，也不需要处理路径，因此非常适合默认资源、字体、着色器和小工具。对于大型资源集，请从磁盘加载，这样修改资源时无需重新构建。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:103
msgid ""
"A common pattern is to embed in release builds and load from disk in debug "
"builds, for hot reloading:"
msgstr "一种常见模式是在发布构建中嵌入，在调试构建中从磁盘加载，以便热重载："

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:110
