#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:128
msgid ""
"`Cow<'static, str>` (\"clone on write\") holds either a borrowed `&'static "
"str` or an owned `String`, so both branches return the same type without "
"copying the embedded text."
msgstr ""
"`Cow<'static, str>`（\"写时克隆\"）要么持有借用的 `&'static str`，要么持有拥有的 "
"`String`，因此两个分支返回相同的类型，且不必复制嵌入的文本。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:134
msgid ""
"[serde](https://serde.rs) is the standard serialization framework. You "
"derive `Serialize` and `Deserialize` on your types, and pick a format crate:"
" `serde_json`, `ron` (Rusty Object Notation, popular for game data), `toml`,"
" `bincode` or `postcard` (compact binary), `rmp-serde` (MessagePack). The "
"derive generates code at compile time from the type definition, so there is "
"no runtime reflection and no schema file. It is the replacement for the "
"reflection macros and code generators C++ engines use for this "
"([Macros](../systems/macros.md) explains derives)."
msgstr ""
"[serde](https://serde.rs) 是标准的序列化框架。你在类型上派生 `Serialize` 和 "
"`Deserialize`，再选择一个格式 crate：`serde_json`、`ron`（Rusty Object "
"Notation，在游戏数据中很流行）、`toml`、`bincode` 或 `postcard`（紧凑的二进制格式）、`rmp-"
"serde`（MessagePack）。派生宏在编译期根据类型定义生成代码，所以没有运行时反射，也没有模式文件。它取代了 C++ "
"引擎为此使用的反射宏和代码生成器（[宏](../systems/macros.md)一章解释了派生）。"

