#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:177
msgid "Points for C++ programmers:"
msgstr "C++ 程序员需要注意的几点："

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:179
msgid ""
"Enums serialize naturally, including variants with data, which is awkward in"
" most C++ serializers."
msgstr "枚举可以自然地序列化，包括带数据的变体，而这在大多数 C++ 序列化器中都很别扭；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:181
msgid ""
"Errors are values with position information (\"missing field `shader` at "
"line 2 column 1\"), not crashes or silently default-initialized fields."
msgstr ""
"错误是带有位置信息的值（\"missing field `shader` at line 2 column "
"1\"），而不是崩溃或悄悄地默认初始化的字段；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:183
msgid ""
"The same derive works for every format. A level can be RON while you edit it"
" and bincode when you ship it, with no code change."
msgstr "同一个派生适用于所有格式。关卡在编辑时可以是 RON，发布时是 bincode，无需修改代码；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:185
msgid ""
"Attributes customize the mapping: `rename`, `default`, `skip`, `flatten`, "
"`with = \"module\"` for custom field encoding."
msgstr ""
"属性可以自定义映射：`rename`、`default`、`skip`、`flatten`，以及用于自定义字段编码的 `with = "
"\"module\"`。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:188
msgid ""
"For zero-copy loading of large binary assets (the \"mmap the file and cast "
"it\" technique), serde is the wrong tool. Use `bytemuck` on `#[repr(C)]` "
"data ([Math and SIMD](math-and-simd.md)) or the [rkyv](https://docs.rs/rkyv)"
" crate, which validates a byte buffer once and then gives you references "
"into it."
msgstr ""
"对于大型二进制资源的零拷贝加载（\"mmap 文件然后强制转换\"的技巧），serde 是错误的工具。请对 `#[repr(C)]` 数据使用 "
"`bytemuck`（[数学与 SIMD](math-and-simd.md)），或者使用 [rkyv](https://docs.rs/rkyv) "
"crate，它对字节缓冲区验证一次，然后给出指向其中的引用。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:193
msgid "An asset cache with typed handles"
msgstr "带类型化句柄的资源缓存"

