#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:297
msgid "What the types guarantee:"
msgstr "类型保证了什么："

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:299
msgid ""
"`T: Send` on `Asset` is required because the loaded value crosses from the "
"worker thread to the main thread. A texture type holding an `Rc` would be "
"rejected at compile time."
msgstr "`Asset` 上的 `T: Send` 是必需的，因为加载好的值要从工作线程传到主线程。一个持有 `Rc` 的纹理类型会在编译期被拒绝；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:302
msgid ""
"`Handle<Texture>` and `Handle<Mesh>` are different types, so they cannot be "
"mixed up."
msgstr "`Handle<Texture>` 和 `Handle<Mesh>` 是不同的类型，因此不会混淆；"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:304
msgid ""
"`get` returns `Option<&T>`: code that renders must decide what to do while "
"an asset is still loading (skip it, or use a placeholder). It cannot forget."
msgstr "`get` 返回 `Option<&T>`：负责渲染的代码必须决定资源仍在加载时该怎么做（跳过，或使用占位符）。它不可能忘记。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:307
msgid ""
"A production version uses a thread pool (rayon, or the engine's job system) "
"instead of a thread per load, adds reference counting to unload unused "
"assets, and keeps generation numbers in handles. The "
"[bevy_asset](https://docs.rs/bevy_asset) crate is a full-featured example of"
" this design."
msgstr ""
"生产版本会使用线程池（rayon，或引擎的任务系统）而不是每次加载一个线程，添加引用计数以卸载不再使用的资源，并在句柄中保存代数编号。[bevy_asset](https://docs.rs/bevy_asset)"
" crate 是这种设计的一个功能完备的例子。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:313
msgid "Watching files"
msgstr "监视文件"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:315
msgid ""
"For hot reloading assets in development, the "
"[notify](https://docs.rs/notify) crate wraps the OS file-watching APIs "
"(`ReadDirectoryChangesW`, FSEvents, inotify):"
msgstr ""
"为了在开发中热重载资源，[notify](https://docs.rs/notify) crate 封装了操作系统的文件监视 "
"API（`ReadDirectoryChangesW`、FSEvents、inotify）："

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:326
msgid "// Once per frame:\n"
msgstr "// 每帧一次：\n"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:331
msgid "// re-run the loader, replace the slot\n"
msgstr "// 重新运行加载器，替换槽位\n"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:337
msgid ""
"Because the rest of the engine holds handles, not references, replacing the "
"slot's contents is invisible to users: the next `get` returns the new data. "
"Editors save files in several steps (write a temp file, rename), so "
"debounce: collect changed paths for a few hundred milliseconds before "
"reloading. The `notify-debouncer-full` crate does this."
msgstr ""
"因为引擎的其余部分持有的是句柄而不是引用，替换槽位的内容对使用者是透明的：下一次 `get` "
"就会返回新数据。编辑器保存文件分好几步（写临时文件，再重命名），所以需要去抖：在重新加载之前，先收集几百毫秒内变化的路径。`notify-"
"debouncer-full` crate 可以做到这一点。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:345
msgid ""
"An engine is several crates: the core, the renderer, the editor, tools, the "
"game. A **Cargo workspace** builds them together with one `Cargo.lock` and "
"one `target/` directory, like a top-level `CMakeLists.txt` with "
"`add_subdirectory` for each component:"
msgstr ""
"一个引擎由多个 crate 组成：核心、渲染器、编辑器、工具、游戏。**Cargo 工作空间**用一个 `Cargo.lock` 和一个 "
"`target/` 目录把它们一起构建，就像一个顶层 `CMakeLists.txt` 为每个组件调用 `add_subdirectory`："

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:350
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# Cargo.toml at the repository root\n"
"[workspace]\n"
"resolver = \"3\"\n"
"members = [\"crates/*\", \"game\", \"tools/asset-cooker\"]\n"
"\n"
"[workspace.package]\n"
"edition = \"2024\"\n"
"license = \"MIT OR Apache-2.0\"\n"
"\n"
"[workspace.dependencies]          # one version of each dependency, chosen here\n"
"glam = { version = \"0.30\", features = [\"bytemuck\"] }\n"
"wgpu = \"27\"\n"
"serde = { version = \"1\", features = [\"derive\"] }\n"
"\n"
"[workspace.lints.clippy]\n"
"undocumented_unsafe_blocks = \"warn\"\n"
"\n"
"[profile.dev.package.\"*\"]\n"
"opt-level = 2                     # optimize dependencies even in debug builds\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:372
msgid ""
"```toml\n"
"# crates/renderer/Cargo.toml\n"
"[package]\n"
"name = \"engine-renderer\"\n"
"version = \"0.1.0\"\n"
"edition.workspace = true\n"
"\n"
"[dependencies]\n"
"engine-core = { path = \"../core\" }\n"
"glam.workspace = true\n"
"wgpu.workspace = true\n"
"\n"
"[lints]\n"
"workspace = true\n"
"```"
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:388
msgid ""
"The `[profile.dev.package.\"*\"]` setting deserves attention: it compiles "
"all dependencies with optimizations while your own crates stay in fast-to-"
"compile debug mode. A debug build of a game that uses an unoptimized math "
"library or image decoder can be unplayably slow; this fixes it, at the cost "
"of a longer first build."
msgstr ""
"`[profile.dev.package.\"*\"]` 这个设置值得注意：它让所有依赖都开启优化编译，而你自己的 crate "
"保持在编译快速的调试模式。如果游戏的调试构建使用了未优化的数学库或图像解码器，可能会慢到无法游玩；这个设置解决了这个问题，代价是首次构建更久。"

#: src/engine/assets-and-build.md:394
