#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:101
msgid "Two lifetime details make this safer than the C++ equivalent:"
msgstr "有两个生命周期细节让它比 C++ 中的等价写法更安全："

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:103
msgid ""
"`Symbol<'lib, T>` borrows the `Library`. You cannot unload the library "
"(`drop(lib)`) while a `Symbol` from it is still alive: that is a compile "
"error, not a crash in code that no longer exists."
msgstr ""
"`Symbol<'lib, T>` 借用 `Library`。当来自它的 `Symbol` "
"还活着时，你不能卸载库（`drop(lib)`）：这是一个编译错误，而不是在已不存在的代码中崩溃；"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:106
msgid ""
"But a plain function pointer copied out of a symbol, or a `&'static str` "
"pointing into the library's data, escapes that check. Before unloading, make"
" sure nothing from the library is still referenced: no function pointers, no"
" trait objects whose vtables live in it, no threads running its code, no "
"`'static` data from it."
msgstr ""
"但从符号中复制出来的普通函数指针，或者指向库数据的 `&'static "
"str`，会逃过这项检查。在卸载之前，确保库中的任何东西都不再被引用：没有函数指针，没有虚表位于其中的 trait "
"对象，没有运行其代码的线程，没有来自它的 `'static` 数据。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:112
msgid "Hot reloading game code"
msgstr "热重载游戏代码"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:114
msgid ""
"The classic setup splits the program into a small host that owns the window,"
" the memory and the main loop, and a game library that contains the logic. "
"On each frame, the host checks whether the library changed and reloads it. "
"The key design rule is the same as in C++: **the state lives in the host; "
"the library only contains functions.** Then reloading swaps the code and "
"keeps the world."
msgstr ""
"经典的结构把程序拆分为一个拥有窗口、内存和主循环的小型宿主，以及一个包含逻辑的游戏库。每一帧，宿主检查库是否有变化并重新加载。关键的设计规则与 C++ "
"中相同：**状态存放在宿主中；库只包含函数**。这样，重载就是替换代码而保留世界。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:121
msgid ""
"The runnable example below simulates this with function pointers instead of "
"a real library, but the structure is the one you would use:"
msgstr "下面的可运行示例用函数指针而不是真正的库来模拟这一点，但结构就是你实际会使用的结构："

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:125
msgid ""
"// Shared between host and game library: #[repr(C)] so both builds agree on "
"it.\n"
msgstr "// 由宿主和游戏库共享：#[repr(C)] 使两边的构建对它达成一致。\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:133
msgid "// The game library's interface: plain C-ABI function pointers.\n"
msgstr "// 游戏库的接口：普通的 C ABI 函数指针。\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:139
msgid "// --- Version 1 of the game library ---\n"
msgstr "// --- 游戏库的第 1 版 ---\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:145
msgid ""
"// --- Version 2, after you edit and rebuild: the player is faster and "
"scores ---\n"
msgstr "// --- 第 2 版，在你编辑并重新构建之后：玩家更快，并且会得分 ---\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:154
msgid "// owned by the host: survives reloads\n"
msgstr "// 由宿主拥有：在重载后依然存在\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:155
msgid "// in reality: loaded from game.dll\n"
msgstr "// 实际中：从 game.dll 加载\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:159
msgid "\"-- library changed on disk: reloading --\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:160
msgid "// unload old library, load new one\n"
msgstr "// 卸载旧库，加载新库\n"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:163
msgid "\"{state:?}\""
msgstr ""

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:168
msgid "With a real library, the reload step is:"
msgstr "使用真正的库时，重载步骤是："

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:170
msgid ""
"Copy `game.dll` to a temporary name and load the copy, so the compiler can "
"overwrite the original while it is loaded (Windows locks loaded DLLs)."
msgstr ""
"把 `game.dll` 复制为一个临时名称并加载这个副本，这样编译器可以在它被加载时覆盖原文件（Windows 会锁定已加载的 DLL）。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:172
msgid "Look up the `GameApi` (one exported function returning the table)."
msgstr "查找 `GameApi`（一个返回函数表的导出函数）。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:173
msgid "Drop the old `Library` after the new one is loaded."
msgstr "在新库加载之后丢弃旧的 `Library`。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:175
msgid "Things that break across a reload, and how to avoid them:"
msgstr "在重载过程中会出问题的东西，以及如何避免："

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:177
msgid ""
"**Changing the layout of `GameState`.** The new code would interpret the old"
" bytes differently. Either restart when the state struct changes, or "
"serialize the state with serde before unloading and deserialize after, which"
" also lets you add fields."
msgstr ""
"**改变 `GameState` 的布局。** 新代码会以不同方式解释旧的字节。要么在状态结构体改变时重启，要么在卸载前用 serde "
"序列化状态、在加载后反序列化，这样还能添加字段；"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:181
msgid ""
"**Heap data allocated by the old library.** With Rust's default global "
"allocator, every `cdylib` uses the system allocator, so a `Vec` allocated in"
" the library and freed in the host works in practice. But a `Vec`'s _layout_"
" is not guaranteed to match across builds; prefer to keep heap-owning types "
"in the host, or use the same compiler for both, which is the normal case in "
"development."
msgstr ""
"**由旧库分配的堆数据。** 使用 Rust 的默认全局分配器时，每个 `cdylib` 都使用系统分配器，所以在库中分配、在宿主中释放的 `Vec` "
"在实践中可以工作。但 `Vec` "
"的<em>布局</em>并不保证在不同构建之间一致；最好把拥有堆内存的类型放在宿主中，或者两边使用同一个编译器，这在开发中是常态；"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:187
msgid ""
"**Statics and thread-locals** in the library are reset on reload. Keep state"
" in `GameState`."
msgstr "库中的**静态变量和线程局部变量**在重载时会被重置。把状态放在 `GameState` 中；"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:189
msgid ""
"**Trait objects and closures** whose code lives in the library dangle after "
"unloading. Do not store them in the host."
msgstr "代码位于库中的 **trait 对象和闭包**在卸载后会悬垂。不要把它们存放在宿主中。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:192
msgid "Hot-reload tools"
msgstr "热重载工具"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:194
msgid "You rarely need to write the loader by hand:"
msgstr "你很少需要手写加载器："

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:196
msgid "How it works"
msgstr "工作原理"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:198
msgid "[hot-lib-reloader](https://docs.rs/hot-lib-reloader)"
msgstr "[hot-lib-reloader](https://docs.rs/hot-lib-reloader)"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:198
msgid ""
"Generates the libloading code from an attribute on a module: you mark "
"functions as hot-reloadable, and calls go through the latest library. Uses "
"Rust ABI, so same compiler on both sides."
msgstr ""
"根据模块上的属性生成 libloading 代码：你把函数标记为可热重载，调用就会经过最新的库。使用 Rust ABI，所以两边需要同一个编译器。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:199
msgid "[subsecond](https://docs.rs/subsecond) (from the Dioxus project)"
msgstr "[subsecond](https://docs.rs/subsecond)（来自 Dioxus 项目）"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:199
msgid ""
"Patches individual functions in a running binary, like Live++, without "
"splitting into a library. Wrap the frame call in `subsecond::call(...)`; "
"changed functions are swapped in. Requires its CLI (`dx`) to drive the "
"build."
msgstr ""
"像 Live++ 一样修补正在运行的二进制中的单个函数，无需拆分出库。把帧调用包装在 `subsecond::call(...)` "
"中；被修改的函数会被替换进来。需要它的 CLI（`dx`）来驱动构建。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:200
msgid "Bevy's hot reloading"
msgstr "Bevy 的热重载"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:200
msgid ""
"Assets and shaders reload out of the box; code hot patching is built on "
"subsecond."
msgstr "资源和着色器开箱即可重载；代码热修补基于 subsecond 构建。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:202
msgid ""
"For assets and shaders, which change much more often than code, reload data "
"instead ([Assets](assets-and-build.md)). It needs no unsafe code and works "
"on every platform."
msgstr ""
"对于比代码变化频繁得多的资源和着色器，改为重载数据（[资源](assets-and-build.md)）。它不需要 unsafe "
"代码，并且在每个平台上都能工作。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:206
msgid "Scripting"
msgstr "脚本"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:208
msgid ""
"Many engines put gameplay logic in a scripting language, for fast iteration "
"and for modders. The usual choices all have good Rust embeddings:"
