#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:237
msgid ""
"Argument conversion is generated from the Rust types (`(String, f32, f32)`),"
" and a wrong type in the script becomes a Lua error, not a crash. Compared "
"with writing Lua bindings in C++ by hand (or with sol2), there is less glue "
"and the borrow checker prevents a script callback from holding a Rust "
"reference beyond its call."
msgstr ""
"参数转换由 Rust 类型（`(String, f32, f32)`）生成，脚本中的类型错误会变成 Lua 错误，而不是崩溃。与用 C++ 手写 Lua"
" 绑定（或使用 sol2）相比，胶水代码更少，而且借用检查器会阻止脚本回调在调用结束后继续持有 Rust 引用。"

#: src/engine/hot-reload-and-plugins.md:243
msgid ""
"WebAssembly is worth a closer look for mods: each mod runs in a sandbox with"
" its own memory, can only call the functions you give it, and can be "
"compiled from Rust with the same toolchain as the engine. Fuel metering in "
"wasmtime lets you cap how many instructions a script runs per frame."
msgstr ""
"对于 mod 来说，WebAssembly 值得仔细看看：每个 mod "
"都在拥有独立内存的沙箱中运行，只能调用你提供给它的函数，并且可以用与引擎相同的工具链从 Rust 编译。wasmtime 中的燃料计量（fuel "
"metering）让你可以限制脚本每帧运行的指令数。"

