#: src/engine/case-study.md:197
msgid ""
"The program has no `unsafe`, no `Rc`, no `RefCell` and no global state, and "
"it did not need them. Note also what it does not contain: no \"manager\" "
"objects holding pointers to each other. Data flows down from `main` by "
"borrowing:"
msgstr ""
"这个程序没有 `unsafe`、没有 `Rc`、没有 "
"`RefCell`，也没有全局状态，而且它也不需要这些。还要注意它不包含什么：没有互相持有指针的\"管理器\"对象。数据通过借用从 `main` "
"向下流动："

#: src/engine/case-study.md:209
msgid ""
"Each frame, `spin_system` gets exclusive access to transforms; then "
"`render_world` gets shared access to the world and the assets and exclusive "
"access to the renderer. The borrow checker verifies that these phases do not"
" overlap. If you later run systems in parallel, the same signatures tell you"
" which ones can run together."
msgstr ""
"每一帧，`spin_system` 获得对变换的独占访问；然后 `render_world` "
"获得对世界和资源的共享访问，以及对渲染器的独占访问。借用检查器验证这些阶段不会重叠。如果以后要并行运行系统，同样的签名会告诉你哪些系统可以同时运行。"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:215
msgid "Replacing the back end with wgpu"
msgstr "把后端替换为 wgpu"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:217
msgid ""
"The `Renderer` trait is the seam between the engine and the GPU. A wgpu back"
" end implements the same three methods, using what the [wgpu "
"chapter](wgpu.md) introduced. The essential parts:"
msgstr ""
"`Renderer` trait 是引擎与 GPU 之间的接缝。wgpu 后端使用 [wgpu "
"一章](wgpu.md)介绍的内容实现同样的三个方法。核心部分如下："

#: src/engine/case-study.md:229
msgid "// per-draw transforms, rewritten each frame\n"
msgstr "// 每次绘制的变换，每帧重写\n"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:230
msgid "// indexed like Assets<Mesh>\n"
msgstr "// 与 Assets<Mesh> 使用相同的索引\n"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:231
msgid "// draws collected between begin and end\n"
msgstr "// 在 begin 和 end 之间收集的绘制\n"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:272
msgid ""
"And the loop moves into winit's `ApplicationHandler` ([Game loop](game-"
"loop.md)): `RedrawRequested` runs the fixed-step systems for the elapsed "
"time, calls `render_world`, and requests the next redraw. Nothing in "
"`World`, `Assets` or the systems changes. That is the payoff of the "
"ownership-first design: the engine core is plain data and functions, and the"
" platform layer is a thin shell around it."
msgstr ""
"循环则移入 winit 的 `ApplicationHandler`（[游戏循环](game-loop.md)）：`RedrawRequested` "
"按经过的时间运行固定步长系统，调用 `render_world`，并请求下一次重绘。`World`、`Assets` "
"和各个系统都无需改动。这就是所有权优先设计的回报：引擎核心是普通的数据和函数，平台层只是包在外面的一层薄壳。"

