#: src/engine/case-study.md:314
msgid ""
"Each crate depends only on the ones below it. The renderer does not know "
"about the game; the game knows the renderer only through `core` types and "
"the `Renderer` API. Cargo enforces the dependency direction: a cycle between"
" crates does not build."
msgstr ""
"每个 crate 只依赖它下面的 crate。渲染器不知道游戏的存在；游戏只通过 `core` 类型和 `Renderer` API "
"了解渲染器。Cargo 强制执行依赖方向：crate 之间的循环依赖无法构建。"

