#: src/engine/case-study.md:321
msgid ""
"Read the source of a real engine. [Bevy](https://bevyengine.org) is large, "
"modular and well documented; [Fyrox](https://fyrox.rs) is a more classic "
"editor-centric engine; [macroquad](https://macroquad.rs) is a small, "
"immediate-mode framework that is pleasant to read in an afternoon."
msgstr ""
"阅读一个真实引擎的源码。[Bevy](https://bevyengine.org) "
"规模大、模块化且文档完善；[Fyrox](https://fyrox.rs) "
"是更经典的以编辑器为中心的引擎；[macroquad](https://macroquad.rs) 是一个小型的立即模式框架，花一个下午读起来很愉快；"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:325
msgid ""
"Port a small piece of your own C++ code: a math library, an allocator, a "
"file format parser. Run Clippy on the result and read every suggestion."
msgstr "移植一小段你自己的 C++ 代码：数学库、分配器、文件格式解析器。对结果运行 Clippy，并阅读每一条建议；"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:327
msgid ""
"When something fights the borrow checker, try restructuring the data before "
"reaching for `Rc<RefCell<...>>` or `unsafe`. The book's [cheat "
"sheet](../appendix/cheat-sheet.md) collects the usual translations."
msgstr ""
"当某处与借用检查器较劲时，先尝试重构数据，再考虑 `Rc<RefCell<...>>` 或 "
"`unsafe`。本书的[速查表](../appendix/cheat-sheet.md)汇集了常见的翻译方式。"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:333
msgid ""
"Add a `Velocity` column and a `movement_system`, and make the triangle drift"
" across the screen. Which existing function signatures change?"
msgstr "添加一个 `Velocity` 列和一个 `movement_system`，让三角形在屏幕上漂移。哪些现有的函数签名需要改变？"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:335
msgid ""
"Add a second renderer, `CountingRenderer`, that only counts triangles and "
"returns `\"N triangles\"` from `end_frame`. Render the same world with both,"
" without changing `render_world`."
msgstr ""
"添加第二个渲染器 `CountingRenderer`，它只统计三角形数量，并从 `end_frame` 返回 `\"N "
"triangles\"`。在不修改 `render_world` 的情况下，用两个渲染器渲染同一个世界。"

#: src/engine/case-study.md:338
msgid ""
"Make `render_world` generic (`renderer: &mut impl Renderer`) instead of "
"taking `&mut dyn Renderer`. What changes in the compiled program, and does "
"it matter here?"
msgstr ""
"让 `render_world` 成为泛型（`renderer: &mut impl Renderer`），而不是接收 `&mut dyn "
"Renderer`。编译出的程序会有什么变化？在这里这重要吗？"

#: src/appendix/cheat-sheet.md:3
msgid ""
"A quick reference: the C++ thing you reach for, its usual Rust spelling, and"
" the chapter that explains it. When the translation is not one-to-one, the "
"chapter is worth reading before you rely on the table. For what a single "
"symbol such as `!`, `&mut`, `'a` or `?` means, see [Reading Rust "
"syntax](../intro/syntax.md)."
msgstr ""
"一份快速参考：你习惯使用的 C++ 写法、它在 Rust "
"中通常的写法，以及讲解它的章节。当翻译不是一对一时，在依赖这张表之前，值得先读一读对应章节。想知道 `!`、`&mut`、`'a` 或 `?` "
"这样的单个符号是什么意思，请看[读懂 Rust 语法](../intro/syntax.md)。"

